(1026940, 122893, 15811, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and the water moving definately makes the image fit the challenge.  Your greens really stand out to me and look crisp.  My eye sort of wanders around the photo a little bit trying to find something to stop at but it sort of never really does.  Maybe because the focus seems a bit soft throughout the image.  Great concept -- good work!</td>', 'This is a great shot and the water moving definately makes the image fit the challenge.  Your greens really stand out to me and look crisp.  My eye sort of wanders around the photo a little bit trying to find something to stop at but it sort of never really does.  Maybe because the focus seems a bit soft throughout the image.  Great concept -- good work!', '2004-11-22 08:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026941, 121663, 27482, '<td valign="top">I knew there were going to be a lot of these clock shots in the challenge, but you put a very interesting twist on the image with having the statue in the shot.  I love the lighting of the small statue and the "pose" you put it in.  Good effort, I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I knew there were going to be a lot of these clock shots in the challenge, but you put a very interesting twist on the image with having the statue in the shot.  I love the lighting of the small statue and the "pose" you put it in.  Good effort, I gave it an 8.', '2004-11-22 08:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026942, 123130, 15811, '<td valign="top">Great picture -- the fence gives my eye something to follow throughout the image and it''s very easy to look at.  The focus may be a bit soft, and while it is obviously a photograph of a specific time, I just don''t see any ''time passing" while I look at it.</td>', 'Great picture -- the fence gives my eye something to follow throughout the image and it''s very easy to look at.  The focus may be a bit soft, and while it is obviously a photograph of a specific time, I just don''t see any ''time passing" while I look at it.', '2004-11-22 08:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
