(1027130, 122528, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot of rust, but in itself not really interesting, that is why I "only" gave it a 7.<br/> <br/>However, this would probably look very good on an album cover for a band, or a commercial, anything where you can put text on this and then print it.</td>', 'Great shot of rust, but in itself not really interesting, that is why I "only" gave it a 7. However, this would probably look very good on an album cover for a band, or a commercial, anything where you can put text on this and then print it.', '2004-11-22 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027133, 123037, 9939, '<td valign="top">Wow- I really like the idea of this image. The composition is great, obviously well shot. I really like selective desat in certain situations, but it doesn''t work for me at all here- it detracts instead of lending itself to the theme. there''s also something really weird going on with the book, as if it was way oversharpened. Giving this a 5 for it''s pros and cons.</td>', 'Wow- I really like the idea of this image. The composition is great, obviously well shot. I really like selective desat in certain situations, but it doesn''t work for me at all here- it detracts instead of lending itself to the theme. there''s also something really weird going on with the book, as if it was way oversharpened. Giving this a 5 for it''s pros and cons.', '2004-11-22 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027134, 123045, 9939, '<td valign="top">A very common idea in this challenge, but I really like the execution of this one- appeals to my sense of symmetry ;)</td>', 'A very common idea in this challenge, but I really like the execution of this one- appeals to my sense of symmetry ;)', '2004-11-22 10:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027154, 123003, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great idea- not sure how you did it, but I like the fact that you even tried to match the lighting!<br/> <br/>II just recently calibrated my monitor and the background behind the two heads is quite distracting. Maybe on darker monitors it isn''t as visible?</td>', 'Great idea- not sure how you did it, but I like the fact that you even tried to match the lighting! II just recently calibrated my monitor and the background behind the two heads is quite distracting. Maybe on darker monitors it isn''t as visible?', '2004-11-22 10:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027156, 123101, 1368, '<td valign="top">LOL this is too funny! Too bad the humor challenge is one week to late for you :D</td>', 'LOL this is too funny! Too bad the humor challenge is one week to late for you :D', '2004-11-22 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027160, 123166, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great colours and contrast but what this photo is lacking IMHO is a focal point to focus your eyes on, there is nothing solid for the eye to rest on and my eye at least wanders all over the frame.  (6)</td>', 'Great colours and contrast but what this photo is lacking IMHO is a focal point to focus your eyes on, there is nothing solid for the eye to rest on and my eye at least wanders all over the frame.  (6)', '2004-11-22 10:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027162, 121666, 9939, '<td valign="top">An amusing idea, but unfortunately poorly done. The lighting  is pretty harsh. Then there''s the fact that he''s stil wearing his boxers. Takes away any realism the shot might have had.</td>', 'An amusing idea, but unfortunately poorly done. The lighting  is pretty harsh. Then there''s the fact that he''s stil wearing his boxers. Takes away any realism the shot might have had.', '2004-11-22 10:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027165, 123083, 9939, '<td valign="top">a good idea that falls because of the small image size and serious lack of sharp detail.</td>', 'a good idea that falls because of the small image size and serious lack of sharp detail.', '2004-11-22 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027167, 123081, 27482, '<td valign="top">I would have removed that green glare to the left but other than that, a great shot, if only you would have had more cars on the left side but that is of course very hard to control.</td>', 'I would have removed that green glare to the left but other than that, a great shot, if only you would have had more cars on the left side but that is of course very hard to control.', '2004-11-22 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027172, 122107, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but it horrifies me to see this cheezy photoshop filter or effect.  I just can´t give this anything but a 1 but please feel free to ignore me, I have been known to be a little bit close minded.</td>', 'Sorry but it horrifies me to see this cheezy photoshop filter or effect.  I just can´t give this anything but a 1 but please feel free to ignore me, I have been known to be a little bit close minded.', '2004-11-22 10:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
