(1027176, 122820, 9939, '<td valign="top">The dates on the headstone make this a little creepy to think about- she''s only 52 and we''re talking about her ending her journey already? He died at 44 and now, what... she''s just passing the time till she dies? Well, to each their own.<br/> <br/>As for the image itself, definitely fits the challenge, nice choice to go black &amp; white.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The dates on the headstone make this a little creepy to think about- she''s only 52 and we''re talking about her ending her journey already? He died at 44 and now, what... she''s just passing the time till she dies? Well, to each their own. As for the image itself, definitely fits the challenge, nice choice to go black & white. ', '2004-11-22 10:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027181, 122742, 9939, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how this was done. I like the three frames and the bright red background. The only thing bothering me from a realistic standpoint is the last frame. Who takes a bite, turns the cookie around, and dunks the other side? Definitely not worth taking off points though!</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how this was done. I like the three frames and the bright red background. The only thing bothering me from a realistic standpoint is the last frame. Who takes a bite, turns the cookie around, and dunks the other side? Definitely not worth taking off points though!', '2004-11-22 10:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027186, 122427, 9939, '<td valign="top">If the hand is to represent death maybe it would do so better if it was lying flat in the dirt. The light is quite hard. Good concept though.</td>', 'If the hand is to represent death maybe it would do so better if it was lying flat in the dirt. The light is quite hard. Good concept though.', '2004-11-22 10:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
