(1027235, 123001, 28771, '<td valign="top">Indeed, nintendo was a great pastime for me. I used to love piddling away the hours in world 8 of super mario bros 3. oh hoow i loved the sound a a fireball flicked off mario''s finger and boom of the tanks.    I guess this meets the challenge, then, but why have you chosen such a dark backdrop?</td>', 'Indeed, nintendo was a great pastime for me. I used to love piddling away the hours in world 8 of super mario bros 3. oh hoow i loved the sound a a fireball flicked off mario''s finger and boom of the tanks.    I guess this meets the challenge, then, but why have you chosen such a dark backdrop?', '2004-11-22 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027236, 123001, 24459, '<td valign="top">Corrrect me if I''m wrong but I can''t shake the impression you coloured the background black in ps. Otherwise I can''t explain the way the cable appears.<br/>Not my favourite.</td>', 'Corrrect me if I''m wrong but I can''t shake the impression you coloured the background black in ps. Otherwise I can''t explain the way the cable appears.Not my favourite.', '2004-11-22 11:02:50.000000', NULL, 1);
