(1027361, 122951, 9763, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  Lighting is a bit bright, but quite appropriate.  The speed is awesome.  Your tilt is a little off though.  Try rotating Counter Clockwise just a hair to get the garbage can/pillar and the building tower perfectly straight.  nice choice of border too!</td>', 'Excellent composition!  Lighting is a bit bright, but quite appropriate.  The speed is awesome.  Your tilt is a little off though.  Try rotating Counter Clockwise just a hair to get the garbage can/pillar and the building tower perfectly straight.  nice choice of border too!', '2004-11-22 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027362, 122816, 9073, '<td valign="top">"Blues" = sadness. Forward steps = positiveness. A slight imbalance in the title and image meaning. Otherwise, a good image. 7</td>', '"Blues" = sadness. Forward steps = positiveness. A slight imbalance in the title and image meaning. Otherwise, a good image. 7', '2004-11-22 12:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027363, 122845, 9763, '<td valign="top">This looks like it took a lot of work!  I love the perfection in the angle of the lights, great job!  are you an architect?  :)  The lighting is not overblown, which is very nice, but it is a bit dark in the lower left of the frame of this photo.  I like the photo a lot, but I think I''d like to see the background more gold/yellow or green even.  Good job!</td>', 'This looks like it took a lot of work!  I love the perfection in the angle of the lights, great job!  are you an architect?  :)  The lighting is not overblown, which is very nice, but it is a bit dark in the lower left of the frame of this photo.  I like the photo a lot, but I think I''d like to see the background more gold/yellow or green even.  Good job!', '2004-11-22 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027364, 122352, 9073, '<td valign="top">There''s too much black. I''d like a closer crop on the waterfall and the swimmer. 5</td>', 'There''s too much black. I''d like a closer crop on the waterfall and the swimmer. 5', '2004-11-22 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027367, 123090, 9763, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see your title, as I am used to beaches like this that aren''t in danger of erosion, but perhaps your area is not this shallow... i''ll give you that.  :)  I like the sepia, but I would prefer more dark tones and contrast.  I also think the buildings are a little to tight to the edge (top left) and could use more sky above them.  I like the detail in the water.</td>', 'I don''t really see your title, as I am used to beaches like this that aren''t in danger of erosion, but perhaps your area is not this shallow... i''ll give you that.  :)  I like the sepia, but I would prefer more dark tones and contrast.  I also think the buildings are a little to tight to the edge (top left) and could use more sky above them.  I like the detail in the water.', '2004-11-22 12:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027371, 122999, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great animal photo!  Is this a real dog?  It sure looks like it with that wet nose!  Poor thing!!!!  Excellent composition!  Lighting in upper right is a bit harsh but doesn''t really take away from the photo.  I like it!</td>', 'Great animal photo!  Is this a real dog?  It sure looks like it with that wet nose!  Poor thing!!!!  Excellent composition!  Lighting in upper right is a bit harsh but doesn''t really take away from the photo.  I like it!', '2004-11-22 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027373, 121663, 9763, '<td valign="top">Your photo is so close to perfect!!!  I just wish the top wasn''t so close to the frame edge.  If you matched it to the left side (blackness around the clock edge) it would be a perfect 10.  I LOVE this photo!  Excellent!</td>', 'Your photo is so close to perfect!!!  I just wish the top wasn''t so close to the frame edge.  If you matched it to the left side (blackness around the clock edge) it would be a perfect 10.  I LOVE this photo!  Excellent!', '2004-11-22 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027377, 123109, 9763, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but the edge of the desk gets into the photo subject too much, and it''s not 180 degrees on the horizon line.  You may need to rotate the photo CC a little to get the horizon line perfect.  The book is great!!!!.  I also think you need a little more contrast.  I like this overall :)</td>', 'I love the idea, but the edge of the desk gets into the photo subject too much, and it''s not 180 degrees on the horizon line.  You may need to rotate the photo CC a little to get the horizon line perfect.  The book is great!!!!.  I also think you need a little more contrast.  I like this overall :)', '2004-11-22 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027380, 122354, 9763, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this feel!  This looks a lot like Bobster''s work.  I love cemeteries and this soft, fantasy look with super high saturation!  Excellent job!  The only thing I would try to change is the very dark upper right corner, but I am really not sure how you could get that lighter without lamps pointing in that direction.. would take a lot of work and money.  Great job though... I really love this.</td>', 'I LOVE this feel!  This looks a lot like Bobster''s work.  I love cemeteries and this soft, fantasy look with super high saturation!  Excellent job!  The only thing I would try to change is the very dark upper right corner, but I am really not sure how you could get that lighter without lamps pointing in that direction.. would take a lot of work and money.  Great job though... I really love this.', '2004-11-22 12:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027382, 122028, 28003, '<td valign="top">A little too light... the sepia tone would be more effective if the blacks remained black.</td>', 'A little too light... the sepia tone would be more effective if the blacks remained black.', '2004-11-22 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027385, 122470, 13610, '<td valign="top">Appealing shot but the subject in the challenge point of view is too small. It look more like a generic cityscape shot with an accidental clock in it than a specific "passing time" themed photography. The focus being on the plant in the foreground an maybe not at hyperfocal make the subject look slightly blurred. (5)</td>', 'Appealing shot but the subject in the challenge point of view is too small. It look more like a generic cityscape shot with an accidental clock in it than a specific "passing time" themed photography. The focus being on the plant in the foreground an maybe not at hyperfocal make the subject look slightly blurred. (5)', '2004-11-22 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
