(1027404, 122741, 20210, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this idea before, even considered it myself.  Good job finding a nice array of leaves, and the exposure is solid.  The composition doesn''t really add to the effect for me at all.  There''s too much negative space, and the eye isn''t really brought in circles back through the photo.  Sort of runs left to right, and then the impact is finished.</td>', 'I''ve seen this idea before, even considered it myself.  Good job finding a nice array of leaves, and the exposure is solid.  The composition doesn''t really add to the effect for me at all.  There''s too much negative space, and the eye isn''t really brought in circles back through the photo.  Sort of runs left to right, and then the impact is finished.', '2004-11-22 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027405, 121884, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice use of negative space and the title ties it all together and makes it work.  Only to nitpick though, and I know this is not for you to control but if it had been visible that he had been painting it would have been more effective.  (9)</td>', 'Great shot, nice use of negative space and the title ties it all together and makes it work.  Only to nitpick though, and I know this is not for you to control but if it had been visible that he had been painting it would have been more effective.  (9)', '2004-11-22 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
