(1027680, 122746, 28070, '<td valign="top">This is the inner workings of a time piece, and like a lot of others I don''t see the movement through time.  Just a representation of something that calculates, measures, and tells it.  Pretty good shot. The light at the bottom is blurry and the white frame doesn''t really match the yellow, orange, black color theme you''ve got going on. But all in all I give it a split down the middle with a 5.</td>', 'This is the inner workings of a time piece, and like a lot of others I don''t see the movement through time.  Just a representation of something that calculates, measures, and tells it.  Pretty good shot. The light at the bottom is blurry and the white frame doesn''t really match the yellow, orange, black color theme you''ve got going on. But all in all I give it a split down the middle with a 5.', '2004-11-22 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
