(1027702, 123037, 25397, '<td valign="top">I like the dream-like blur</td>', 'I like the dream-like blur', '2004-11-22 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027707, 122380, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of vintage shaving devices.  I see it more as a present and past picture.  Like so many others your idea of the challenge is different than mine.  My idea of this challenge was to get something that moved in the image so as to blur creating the movement effect of time passing.  Actual passing something through the space time continuum.  I''m not sure if that is how to spell "continuum" but that is what I''m going with.  Good Photo.  You matched the border color perfect with the rest of the picture.  I''ll give it a 7 right in the middle upper class due to the challenge confusion.  I really think they ought to make the challenges a little more specific in detail.</td>', 'Nice picture of vintage shaving devices.  I see it more as a present and past picture.  Like so many others your idea of the challenge is different than mine.  My idea of this challenge was to get something that moved in the image so as to blur creating the movement effect of time passing.  Actual passing something through the space time continuum.  I''m not sure if that is how to spell "continuum" but that is what I''m going with.  Good Photo.  You matched the border color perfect with the rest of the picture.  I''ll give it a 7 right in the middle upper class due to the challenge confusion.  I really think they ought to make the challenges a little more specific in detail.', '2004-11-22 17:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027714, 123004, 25397, '<td valign="top">I hope you get a good place for this! The lighting is perfect.</td>', 'I hope you get a good place for this! The lighting is perfect.', '2004-11-22 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027715, 122954, 28070, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  But the candles at the lower end don''t show any signs of melting wax, which tells me they were all lit at the same time.  I don''t know, I''m not the fluent in the handling or lighting of candles myself.  But the other candle pics I''ve seen were melted all over the sides.</td>', 'Cool idea.  But the candles at the lower end don''t show any signs of melting wax, which tells me they were all lit at the same time.  I don''t know, I''m not the fluent in the handling or lighting of candles myself.  But the other candle pics I''ve seen were melted all over the sides.', '2004-11-22 17:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027762, 123018, 28299, '<td valign="top">A very special photograph. You can see the young girl at heart in her expression and stance. Lots of emotion. The head adornment gives her youthfulness and adds a spark of color to your photo. (By the way, what a gorgeous head of hair!)</td>', 'A very special photograph. You can see the young girl at heart in her expression and stance. Lots of emotion. The head adornment gives her youthfulness and adds a spark of color to your photo. (By the way, what a gorgeous head of hair!)', '2004-11-22 17:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
