(1027864, 123111, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think your picture would have been more dramatic if you would of cropped more on your subject. Good lighting but the subject has little detail and it is soft focused. I wish you would of zoomed in a little more to get the detail.</td>', 'I think your picture would have been more dramatic if you would of cropped more on your subject. Good lighting but the subject has little detail and it is soft focused. I wish you would of zoomed in a little more to get the detail.', '2004-11-22 19:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
