(1027896, 122954, 22970, '<td valign="top">First let me say good photograph. Great lighting and focus. And in this picture I think your border works well. Now what I see that could improve on the challenge theme. All candles seem to be set up in a row perpendicular to the camera lens. So it looks as if you cut the candles to different sizes to create the melting away of the candle over time. I think it would have been better to let this happen naturally by having the candles the same size and light each candle about 3 minutes apart to achieve the same effect but we could of seen the wax  running down the candles. More on the small candles that has been burning longer and progress to little wax melt on the last candle lit. Good job but I think this could have been a great shot. <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'First let me say good photograph. Great lighting and focus. And in this picture I think your border works well. Now what I see that could improve on the challenge theme. All candles seem to be set up in a row perpendicular to the camera lens. So it looks as if you cut the candles to different sizes to create the melting away of the candle over time. I think it would have been better to let this happen naturally by having the candles the same size and light each candle about 3 minutes apart to achieve the same effect but we could of seen the wax  running down the candles. More on the small candles that has been burning longer and progress to little wax melt on the last candle lit. Good job but I think this could have been a great shot.   ', '2004-11-22 19:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027910, 122470, 22970, '<td valign="top">I  see a very nice photograph here but cant see how it relates to time passing. I know there is a clock In the photo but the way you took the picture it is standing still. I would try to be a bit more creative next time because you have the ability to take good photos as seen here. Nice color and lighting. Details are there but I believe they need to be a bit sharper and a crop to make the tower vertical would have helped.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I  see a very nice photograph here but cant see how it relates to time passing. I know there is a clock In the photo but the way you took the picture it is standing still. I would try to be a bit more creative next time because you have the ability to take good photos as seen here. Nice color and lighting. Details are there but I believe they need to be a bit sharper and a crop to make the tower vertical would have helped.  ', '2004-11-22 19:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
