(1028991, 123128, 26679, '<td valign="top">nice idea, when I first saw the thumnail it looked like one of those timeless clasics of the lense cap.  I bet you had fun taking this one.  If it is stars, how did you get all the different colours</td>', 'nice idea, when I first saw the thumnail it looked like one of those timeless clasics of the lense cap.  I bet you had fun taking this one.  If it is stars, how did you get all the different colours', '2004-11-23 13:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
