(1029351, 122186, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph is a good example of time passing. I actually though about this idea but didnt have the skills to pull it off, but you did. Very good technique, I wish you would do a tutorial on how to do this after the challenge is over. 10</td>', 'Your photograph is a good example of time passing. I actually though about this idea but didnt have the skills to pull it off, but you did. Very good technique, I wish you would do a tutorial on how to do this after the challenge is over. 10', '2004-11-23 18:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029357, 122741, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph is a good example of time passing. The colors are great and I like your composition. I think you did great going from green to brown, it makes your photo more dramatic. Works well on the bright white background.</td>', 'Your photograph is a good example of time passing. The colors are great and I like your composition. I think you did great going from green to brown, it makes your photo more dramatic. Works well on the bright white background.', '2004-11-23 18:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
