(1029400, 123066, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean with beautiful detail. Meets the challenge and works as a great abstract/macro also.</td>', 'Very crisp and clean with beautiful detail. Meets the challenge and works as a great abstract/macro also.', '2004-11-23 19:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029403, 123022, 20779, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in a delightfully creative way, with excellent lighting and composition. The model''s face adds just the right spark of interest and humor. Well done comment on time and change. Also - perfect DOF.</td>', 'Meets the challenge in a delightfully creative way, with excellent lighting and composition. The model''s face adds just the right spark of interest and humor. Well done comment on time and change. Also - perfect DOF.', '2004-11-23 19:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029405, 123091, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 for the challenge. It has an almost ethereal lighting coming through which really brings an added diminsion for me in the way it meets the challenge. One of the most creative and well done I''ve seen.</td>', 'One of my top 3 for the challenge. It has an almost ethereal lighting coming through which really brings an added diminsion for me in the way it meets the challenge. One of the most creative and well done I''ve seen.', '2004-11-23 19:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029408, 123130, 20779, '<td valign="top">I just love this image too much to score it anything but high, but I do admit that I am having a hard time latching onto the passing of time concept.</td>', 'I just love this image too much to score it anything but high, but I do admit that I am having a hard time latching onto the passing of time concept.', '2004-11-23 19:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029409, 122887, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simply perfect in conception and execution. The eyes are tack sharp, also - really giving it the impact it should.</td>', 'Simply perfect in conception and execution. The eyes are tack sharp, also - really giving it the impact it should.', '2004-11-23 19:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029415, 122999, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and lighting, but I don''t see anything that connects to the challenge for me (took the hair a long time to grow?), and it also isn''t particularly engaging as a composition.</td>', 'Excellent detail and lighting, but I don''t see anything that connects to the challenge for me (took the hair a long time to grow?), and it also isn''t particularly engaging as a composition.', '2004-11-23 19:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029416, 122952, 23680, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the tinting in this shot, I don''t think it adds anything to it.</td>', 'I don''t care for the tinting in this shot, I don''t think it adds anything to it.', '2004-11-23 19:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029419, 123009, 20779, '<td valign="top">Haunting image and leaves you ready to ponder your own passing of years. The first time I saw this, I think I missed the year. After going through my own "memory box" for this challenge, I think of the person coming back to this tree and running his/her fingers over that carving made so many years ago. Perfect DOF used to really give the imapct required for this image. Great work.</td>', 'Haunting image and leaves you ready to ponder your own passing of years. The first time I saw this, I think I missed the year. After going through my own "memory box" for this challenge, I think of the person coming back to this tree and running his/her fingers over that carving made so many years ago. Perfect DOF used to really give the imapct required for this image. Great work.', '2004-11-23 19:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029426, 122433, 20779, '<td valign="top">This image hit me right between the eyes. These two hands truly look like the past and present versions of the same hand, or of mother and daughter. Being adopted (I have often wondered "whose" hands I have, etc.) and having gone through some of my own memories for this challenge, this "evidence" of the continuance of life, and possibly mother/daughter, really gave this work a lot of meaning for me. Well done, and great lighting and composition also.</td>', 'This image hit me right between the eyes. These two hands truly look like the past and present versions of the same hand, or of mother and daughter. Being adopted (I have often wondered "whose" hands I have, etc.) and having gone through some of my own memories for this challenge, this "evidence" of the continuance of life, and possibly mother/daughter, really gave this work a lot of meaning for me. Well done, and great lighting and composition also.', '2004-11-23 19:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029430, 123113, 20779, '<td valign="top">I just can''t help but love this image and its title. There are many great clock and watch photos in this challenge, but this is one of the few truly fresh and engaging to me.</td>', 'I just can''t help but love this image and its title. There are many great clock and watch photos in this challenge, but this is one of the few truly fresh and engaging to me.', '2004-11-23 19:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029433, 122748, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is such an exceptional and well done photo, that I hope you don''t get scored down for one, being a "flower" picture, and two, for a slightly less obvious time connection. I hope my fears are all wrong and that you get the extremely high score you deserve on this. One of my favorites.</td>', 'This is such an exceptional and well done photo, that I hope you don''t get scored down for one, being a "flower" picture, and two, for a slightly less obvious time connection. I hope my fears are all wrong and that you get the extremely high score you deserve on this. One of my favorites.', '2004-11-23 19:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029436, 123003, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image, and the type of image I had orignally wished to do for this challenge - but didn''t have the skill. I can''t say it is a photo I find interesting enough to "hang on the wall" as a composition, but for the challenge, it is a perfect study of our passing in time.</td>', 'Fascinating image, and the type of image I had orignally wished to do for this challenge - but didn''t have the skill. I can''t say it is a photo I find interesting enough to "hang on the wall" as a composition, but for the challenge, it is a perfect study of our passing in time.', '2004-11-23 19:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029444, 123166, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really love the movement and tone captured in this image. It looks like it was perhaps a result of thinking about the Impressionistic theme we have been seeing. Great hob. I do have to admit that I don''t feel a very strong connection to the passing of time, however.</td>', 'I really love the movement and tone captured in this image. It looks like it was perhaps a result of thinking about the Impressionistic theme we have been seeing. Great hob. I do have to admit that I don''t feel a very strong connection to the passing of time, however.', '2004-11-23 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029450, 122107, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautfiul, clean abstract and terrific sense of composition IMO. I feel that the effect looks like the result of post-editing, and I would personally consider this more digital "art" than photography, but just my personal opinion.</td>', 'Beautfiul, clean abstract and terrific sense of composition IMO. I feel that the effect looks like the result of post-editing, and I would personally consider this more digital "art" than photography, but just my personal opinion.', '2004-11-23 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029455, 122960, 20779, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully done portrait sitting!!!! Wonderfully emotive. I honestly don''t feel that there is a strong connection for me to the challenge, but just my opinion.</td>', 'What a beautifully done portrait sitting!!!! Wonderfully emotive. I honestly don''t feel that there is a strong connection for me to the challenge, but just my opinion.', '2004-11-23 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029459, 121174, 20779, '<td valign="top">Just love the more abstract or less obvious connection to passing time in this one. Terrific composition.</td>', 'Just love the more abstract or less obvious connection to passing time in this one. Terrific composition.', '2004-11-23 20:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029495, 123037, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel and  composition in this one. My two nit-picks are that I personally don''t think the de-sat works in this particular case with these tones, and the image appears jagged in places (like the book).</td>', 'I really like the feel and  composition in this one. My two nit-picks are that I personally don''t think the de-sat works in this particular case with these tones, and the image appears jagged in places (like the book).', '2004-11-23 20:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029499, 122028, 20779, '<td valign="top">The sepia appears very faded almost like an old newspaper clipping - this I really like. The actual image and composition are not particularly interesting or engaging for me. It technically meets the challenge, but I honestly thought decay or destruction before "time" when I first looked at it - but that is a nit-pick.</td>', 'The sepia appears very faded almost like an old newspaper clipping - this I really like. The actual image and composition are not particularly interesting or engaging for me. It technically meets the challenge, but I honestly thought decay or destruction before "time" when I first looked at it - but that is a nit-pick.', '2004-11-23 20:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029504, 122818, 20779, '<td valign="top">Obviously beautifully done and arranged. I have to be honest that I am just one of the minority who doesn''t care for studio shots such as this, so I have had to work at not socring on "tastes" on this.</td>', 'Obviously beautifully done and arranged. I have to be honest that I am just one of the minority who doesn''t care for studio shots such as this, so I have had to work at not socring on "tastes" on this.', '2004-11-23 20:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029509, 123010, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it is a tad bit soft and has a bit of the snapshot look. WIthout the title, it would not meet the challenge, but with the title, it gave me a very emotional response to the image - so in that sense, very well done.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it is a tad bit soft and has a bit of the snapshot look. WIthout the title, it would not meet the challenge, but with the title, it gave me a very emotional response to the image - so in that sense, very well done.', '2004-11-23 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029513, 122763, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and tones. In my opinion, a bit of the "snapshot" look and I don''t really see it meeting the challenge strongly. 6.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and tones. In my opinion, a bit of the "snapshot" look and I don''t really see it meeting the challenge strongly. 6.', '2004-11-23 20:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029535, 122605, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am wondering if you are getting comments about too grainy or too dark - both of which make me really enjoy this image. We''ve all seen shots of antique cameras crisp and bold against a gleaming white background, but for me, you have created it in your own original way. The texture is just wonderful.</td>', 'I am wondering if you are getting comments about too grainy or too dark - both of which make me really enjoy this image. We''ve all seen shots of antique cameras crisp and bold against a gleaming white background, but for me, you have created it in your own original way. The texture is just wonderful.', '2004-11-23 20:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029584, 122699, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photograph. Great composition. The subjects'' expressions complement each other well. Both subjects are animated and engaged, just like my teenage daughters when they are on the telephone. This has a very Norman Rockwell feel to it. Please take that as a compliment. When I was in college taking art classes in the early 80s everyone was bemoaning him as a lowly illustrator. I, however, believe that he captured the essence of the twentith century like no other artist. People seem to finally be coming around to that way of thinking. Your modern subject''s foot moving out of the frame suggesting the future is s nice touch. I lke the simple color choices of red, white and blue - and what could be more American than jeans. Excellent work.</td>', 'Brilliant photograph. Great composition. The subjects'' expressions complement each other well. Both subjects are animated and engaged, just like my teenage daughters when they are on the telephone. This has a very Norman Rockwell feel to it. Please take that as a compliment. When I was in college taking art classes in the early 80s everyone was bemoaning him as a lowly illustrator. I, however, believe that he captured the essence of the twentith century like no other artist. People seem to finally be coming around to that way of thinking. Your modern subject''s foot moving out of the frame suggesting the future is s nice touch. I lke the simple color choices of red, white and blue - and what could be more American than jeans. Excellent work.', '2004-11-23 21:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029626, 123166, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea and beautiful light. I would like to see the splashes (white water) a bit crisper. The concept is a trusim. The older I get the closer I feel to the  rapids. This image has a very impressionist feel. Nice image.</td>', 'Great idea and beautiful light. I would like to see the splashes (white water) a bit crisper. The concept is a trusim. The older I get the closer I feel to the  rapids. This image has a very impressionist feel. Nice image.', '2004-11-23 21:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029639, 123022, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it seems a little heavy-handed. I don''t like the use of National Geographic magazine as the foil because it seems a shade too much like you are using it as  a parallel, and I happen to love National Geographic. To me it seems out of synch with the times because we are moving toward era of censorship and away from any type of freedom of expression. <br/>Great expression on your subject''s face and nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it seems a little heavy-handed. I don''t like the use of National Geographic magazine as the foil because it seems a shade too much like you are using it as  a parallel, and I happen to love National Geographic. To me it seems out of synch with the times because we are moving toward era of censorship and away from any type of freedom of expression. Great expression on your subject''s face and nice composition.', '2004-11-23 21:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029659, 123170, 4793, '<td valign="top">Neat image, very nice work.</td>', 'Neat image, very nice work.', '2004-11-23 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029662, 123003, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Similar lighting, expression and dress. I like that you changed the angle of your modern subject so that he appears to be looking back, or better yet, trying to see what his younger self was seeing, or remembering what he was imagining. The earlier image seems to be looking ahead to the future even though he is not committed toward the right, which is traditional future, so very nicely done. I would like to see the modern subject''s shoulder behind the younger one and moved a touch closer with their heads almost touching and as if he were "standing behind" or supporting his yournger self. So many excellent subtle touches that it is truly a work of art.</td>', 'This is nice. Similar lighting, expression and dress. I like that you changed the angle of your modern subject so that he appears to be looking back, or better yet, trying to see what his younger self was seeing, or remembering what he was imagining. The earlier image seems to be looking ahead to the future even though he is not committed toward the right, which is traditional future, so very nicely done. I would like to see the modern subject''s shoulder behind the younger one and moved a touch closer with their heads almost touching and as if he were "standing behind" or supporting his yournger self. So many excellent subtle touches that it is truly a work of art.', '2004-11-23 21:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029665, 123010, 22384, '<td valign="top">I imagine that this bench brings back memories, and that the shadow represents for grandfather''s life. The leaves and shadow work well together to show the passage of time, and the placement of the bench in the left upper edge adds to the sense of looking back while time marches on. It is the creative use of space that adds that touch of tension that makes this more than just a picture of pretty leaves. Your title did help me to understand the message your image conveys. Nicely done.</td>', 'I imagine that this bench brings back memories, and that the shadow represents for grandfather''s life. The leaves and shadow work well together to show the passage of time, and the placement of the bench in the left upper edge adds to the sense of looking back while time marches on. It is the creative use of space that adds that touch of tension that makes this more than just a picture of pretty leaves. Your title did help me to understand the message your image conveys. Nicely done.', '2004-11-23 21:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029668, 122456, 22384, '<td valign="top">Your image conveys the message nicely but maybe just a bit too nicely. It seems a little traditional. Beautiful crisp images on the face of the timepiece.</td>', 'Your image conveys the message nicely but maybe just a bit too nicely. It seems a little traditional. Beautiful crisp images on the face of the timepiece.', '2004-11-23 21:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029674, 123165, 22384, '<td valign="top">Without the  title, I wouldn''t have know what this was right away. The image is very feminine, and the line is graceful and beautiful. The artist does an outstanding job of capturing the of the movement of the sand and the steady march of time. Creative and risky. Bravo.</td>', 'Without the  title, I wouldn''t have know what this was right away. The image is very feminine, and the line is graceful and beautiful. The artist does an outstanding job of capturing the of the movement of the sand and the steady march of time. Creative and risky. Bravo.', '2004-11-23 21:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029678, 123128, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image works to meet the challenge; however, I have seen it done so many times. The color is a nice touch, which makes it a little edgier.  I would have changed the angle by moving the North Star off center, something to make it seem fresh.</td>', 'This image works to meet the challenge; however, I have seen it done so many times. The color is a nice touch, which makes it a little edgier.  I would have changed the angle by moving the North Star off center, something to make it seem fresh.', '2004-11-23 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029680, 123122, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity and the energy in this photo. Stunning color, composition, and concept. Excellent photograph.</td>', 'I love the creativity and the energy in this photo. Stunning color, composition, and concept. Excellent photograph.', '2004-11-23 21:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029693, 123020, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and I like the use of color from cool blue in the background to warm red in the foreground. I also feel movement in the lines underneath the melting ice. It gives the feeling of the image sliding off the edge of the photo. The artist''s placement of the focal point in the lower left edge of the frame adds to the illusion of movement. All his or her efforts work well to create an overall succes in this image. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice concept and I like the use of color from cool blue in the background to warm red in the foreground. I also feel movement in the lines underneath the melting ice. It gives the feeling of the image sliding off the edge of the photo. The artist''s placement of the focal point in the lower left edge of the frame adds to the illusion of movement. All his or her efforts work well to create an overall succes in this image. Nicely done.', '2004-11-23 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029699, 123083, 22384, '<td valign="top">The brilliant colors of this photograph and the underlying values from black down  the scale to white create a stiking image. This photograph lacks a focal point for me, however, and so it leaves me feeling like it is not quite complete. My eye can''t decide between the trees or the monuements.  I would crop it a bit differently, making the monuements the focal point, framed by the brilliant yellows and golds of the leaves.</td>', 'The brilliant colors of this photograph and the underlying values from black down  the scale to white create a stiking image. This photograph lacks a focal point for me, however, and so it leaves me feeling like it is not quite complete. My eye can''t decide between the trees or the monuements.  I would crop it a bit differently, making the monuements the focal point, framed by the brilliant yellows and golds of the leaves.', '2004-11-23 21:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029712, 122028, 22384, '<td valign="top">There are too many images fighting for my attention. This image is too cluttered. I would have focused on the rotting pier and the image of growing industry in the background.  The photographer has the potential to nail this challenge in this photo, but the battle for my attention weakens the message. <br/>Brilliant crispness in the images, however. The technical aspects of this photo are truly exquisite. With a little more attention to artistic composition, he or she would be hard to beat in a challenge.</td>', 'There are too many images fighting for my attention. This image is too cluttered. I would have focused on the rotting pier and the image of growing industry in the background.  The photographer has the potential to nail this challenge in this photo, but the battle for my attention weakens the message. Brilliant crispness in the images, however. The technical aspects of this photo are truly exquisite. With a little more attention to artistic composition, he or she would be hard to beat in a challenge.', '2004-11-23 21:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029729, 121935, 22384, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photograph. The fact that the building is somewhat obstructed adds an element of losing hold of the past, just beyond our reach our memory. I would like something a bit more dramatic, maybe contrast or a broader range of focus (crisp in the foreground and softer in the background to add to that air of the past, or maybe the other way around). I know that would be risky because it seems most of the voters like their images hyper-crisp, but that riskiness could allow this photo to trascend to the level of art. The artist would have to play around with it to know if it would work.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photograph. The fact that the building is somewhat obstructed adds an element of losing hold of the past, just beyond our reach our memory. I would like something a bit more dramatic, maybe contrast or a broader range of focus (crisp in the foreground and softer in the background to add to that air of the past, or maybe the other way around). I know that would be risky because it seems most of the voters like their images hyper-crisp, but that riskiness could allow this photo to trascend to the level of art. The artist would have to play around with it to know if it would work.', '2004-11-23 22:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029733, 122851, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, very nice. The only thing better would be a wilted flower in place of one of the buds. I know that is asking a bit much. This image works well for me because of the stunning color. It falls a little short in meeting the challenge. Regardless, nice photograph.</td>', 'Oh, very nice. The only thing better would be a wilted flower in place of one of the buds. I know that is asking a bit much. This image works well for me because of the stunning color. It falls a little short in meeting the challenge. Regardless, nice photograph.', '2004-11-23 22:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029743, 122605, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. Stunning line, texture, and the red lighting adds to the image. It is something I have seen done so many times before that it loses me in the area of creativity. The artist has displayed some amazing technical skills.</td>', 'Nice photograph. Stunning line, texture, and the red lighting adds to the image. It is something I have seen done so many times before that it loses me in the area of creativity. The artist has displayed some amazing technical skills.', '2004-11-23 22:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029749, 123119, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and use of framing. I am dog lover, and our golden retriever is 13, so my heart is with you. I like the focus on the muzzle, and the contrast of the texture of the fur and the wetness of the nose and eye. Doesn''t suck that dogs age so quickly? The subject filling the frame, looking back toward the past works well. Nice photo.</td>', 'Interesting angle and use of framing. I am dog lover, and our golden retriever is 13, so my heart is with you. I like the focus on the muzzle, and the contrast of the texture of the fur and the wetness of the nose and eye. Doesn''t suck that dogs age so quickly? The subject filling the frame, looking back toward the past works well. Nice photo.', '2004-11-23 22:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029754, 123001, 22384, '<td valign="top">Too funny. Great idea to use the cord across the page and to have your focal point on the far left side. Interesting photo.</td>', 'Too funny. Great idea to use the cord across the page and to have your focal point on the far left side. Interesting photo.', '2004-11-23 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029760, 123015, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant lighting. I really like the use of shadow in this photo. I like the crisp image in the foreground moving back to softer focus on the leaves. This photo works for me. You have a great eye for color and light. The subtle hues enhance your message. Nice job.</td>', 'Brilliant lighting. I really like the use of shadow in this photo. I like the crisp image in the foreground moving back to softer focus on the leaves. This photo works for me. You have a great eye for color and light. The subtle hues enhance your message. Nice job.', '2004-11-23 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029764, 121884, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative. This is as brilliant a use of massive white space as I have ever seen. It works well for me. Great job, and congratulations at taking a risk!</td>', 'Creative. This is as brilliant a use of massive white space as I have ever seen. It works well for me. Great job, and congratulations at taking a risk!', '2004-11-23 22:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029768, 123113, 22384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and line. The lighting seems a bit conflicted. I am unsure if that is the editing or just the light source.</td>', 'Beautiful color and line. The lighting seems a bit conflicted. I am unsure if that is the editing or just the light source.', '2004-11-23 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029772, 121663, 22384, '<td valign="top">Finally, I get to vote on this guy. Nice use of perspective, The positioning of the figure in a contemplative stance and the apparent movement of the hands (on the clock)work well. Nice photo.</td>', 'Finally, I get to vote on this guy. Nice use of perspective, The positioning of the figure in a contemplative stance and the apparent movement of the hands (on the clock)work well. Nice photo.', '2004-11-23 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029779, 122367, 22384, '<td valign="top">Wow. Technically and artitically magnificent. I like that that babies nails are a little dirty. Nice texture and line. So nice.</td>', 'Wow. Technically and artitically magnificent. I like that that babies nails are a little dirty. Nice texture and line. So nice.', '2004-11-23 22:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029782, 122528, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great texture and color. I need a focal point, though, for a photo to feel complete. Creative idea.</td>', 'Great texture and color. I need a focal point, though, for a photo to feel complete. Creative idea.', '2004-11-23 22:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029787, 123078, 25183, '<td valign="top">hmm...I would like it better if I knew what it was!  I still like the composition though.  8</td>', 'hmm...I would like it better if I knew what it was!  I still like the composition though.  8', '2004-11-23 22:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029791, 123078, 22384, '<td valign="top">This photo certainly give the illusion of movement. There is a hectic, frenetic tension. The artist captures the feeling of pushing the edge for me. The title doesn''t fit with my interpretation, but that is the beauty of subjective art.</td>', 'This photo certainly give the illusion of movement. There is a hectic, frenetic tension. The artist captures the feeling of pushing the edge for me. The title doesn''t fit with my interpretation, but that is the beauty of subjective art.', '2004-11-23 22:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029797, 122999, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, too funny. Thank goodness for that nose, or I wouldn''t have known what I was seeing. Great focal point. I am unsure how this symbolizes the passage of time, but nice use of textures and light.</td>', 'Oh, too funny. Thank goodness for that nose, or I wouldn''t have known what I was seeing. Great focal point. I am unsure how this symbolizes the passage of time, but nice use of textures and light.', '2004-11-23 22:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029803, 121203, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting image in its exoticness. The smoky image adds to  the feeling of memory and of the past. This image doesn''t evoke the passage of time, rather the distant past.</td>', 'Interesting image in its exoticness. The smoky image adds to  the feeling of memory and of the past. This image doesn''t evoke the passage of time, rather the distant past.', '2004-11-23 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029806, 123023, 25183, '<td valign="top">I pity the person who set this up! ;-)  Gross but original...I happen to like originality!  8</td>', 'I pity the person who set this up! ;-)  Gross but original...I happen to like originality!  8', '2004-11-23 22:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029811, 123004, 25183, '<td valign="top">I like the thought.  I like the set up.  I like the lighting and color.  I am wondering how that fully melted ice cube has less water than the ice cube that is only beginning to melt.  7</td>', 'I like the thought.  I like the set up.  I like the lighting and color.  I am wondering how that fully melted ice cube has less water than the ice cube that is only beginning to melt.  7', '2004-11-23 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029814, 122818, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of color. Very cute photograph. I am unsure if it works to reflect the passage of time as well as some of the other entries; however, this is a striking photograph in its own right. My only complaint is that it looks a little too studio for me, a little too staged while trying not to appear to be.</td>', 'Brilliant use of color. Very cute photograph. I am unsure if it works to reflect the passage of time as well as some of the other entries; however, this is a striking photograph in its own right. My only complaint is that it looks a little too studio for me, a little too staged while trying not to appear to be.', '2004-11-23 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029817, 123002, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great use of movement, light, and framing. The contrast could be upped a bit or maybe the color of the background be more of a contrast to give this photo the extra edge to help it trascend to stunning. The concept is brilliant and the placement of the image within the frame is equally well done.</td>', 'Great use of movement, light, and framing. The contrast could be upped a bit or maybe the color of the background be more of a contrast to give this photo the extra edge to help it trascend to stunning. The concept is brilliant and the placement of the image within the frame is equally well done.', '2004-11-23 22:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029822, 123053, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of movement with existing images. The seemingly downward flow of the rust images adds to the idea of decay and decline that comes with time. Well framed and nice use of texture and line.</td>', 'Nice use of movement with existing images. The seemingly downward flow of the rust images adds to the idea of decay and decline that comes with time. Well framed and nice use of texture and line.', '2004-11-23 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029826, 122903, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I would have gotten rid of the glasses, used a contrasting colored pen and let the image speak for itself. A more powerful focal point would tighten the message for me.</td>', 'Great idea. I would have gotten rid of the glasses, used a contrasting colored pen and let the image speak for itself. A more powerful focal point would tighten the message for me.', '2004-11-23 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029832, 121666, 22384, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the effort with humor, but the image doesn''t work for me as time passing. Heck, your subject has his boxers on. Be creative and stage it differently so that everything is safely covered, and then it would at least have the feel of being genuine. I am unsure what to do with this one. Nice variety of textures, anyway...</td>', 'I appreciate the effort with humor, but the image doesn''t work for me as time passing. Heck, your subject has his boxers on. Be creative and stage it differently so that everything is safely covered, and then it would at least have the feel of being genuine. I am unsure what to do with this one. Nice variety of textures, anyway...', '2004-11-23 22:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029836, 123098, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great color and concept. Wow, the foliage in the lower right corner is a beautiful touch. The cropping of the very tip of the rock off the edge of the left side makes me uncomfortable and your subject rests too high in the frame for me to appreciate it fullly. Crop over to the left a bit and move the rock down and see what you think. Keep a hint of those beautiful leaves, or maybe, focus on them instead. I think you haven''t quite decided which picture you want this to be. There is the potential for two stunning images here.</td>', 'Great color and concept. Wow, the foliage in the lower right corner is a beautiful touch. The cropping of the very tip of the rock off the edge of the left side makes me uncomfortable and your subject rests too high in the frame for me to appreciate it fullly. Crop over to the left a bit and move the rock down and see what you think. Keep a hint of those beautiful leaves, or maybe, focus on them instead. I think you haven''t quite decided which picture you want this to be. There is the potential for two stunning images here.', '2004-11-23 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030083, 122427, 17512, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-11-24 00:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030134, 122887, 19936, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait!  Time sometimes passes well and you captured it here.  Great texture, color and composition.</td>', 'Terrific portrait!  Time sometimes passes well and you captured it here.  Great texture, color and composition.', '2004-11-24 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1030158, 121663, 19936, '<td valign="top">The little guy adds that missing element to an otherwise average shot.  Good composition but lacks crispness and clarity.  Maybe slight DOF problem.</td>', 'The little guy adds that missing element to an otherwise average shot.  Good composition but lacks crispness and clarity.  Maybe slight DOF problem.', '2004-11-24 00:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030163, 123036, 18367, '<td valign="top">A fantastic photo. Very clear, and definitely in keeping with the challenge.</td>', 'A fantastic photo. Very clear, and definitely in keeping with the challenge.', '2004-11-24 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030176, 123015, 19936, '<td valign="top">Although my first reaction was one of depression I ended up coming back twice to look at this shot.  I realized it captures an emotion that connects to passing time and is technically perfect.  Great job, one of my top picks.</td>', 'Although my first reaction was one of depression I ended up coming back twice to look at this shot.  I realized it captures an emotion that connects to passing time and is technically perfect.  Great job, one of my top picks.', '2004-11-24 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030182, 122699, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good imagination of idea here.  Really tells a story.  Good job.</td>', 'Good imagination of idea here.  Really tells a story.  Good job.', '2004-11-24 00:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030192, 123109, 19936, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this idea before but it fits well here.  Good capture of the pages flying by.  Could be a bit sharper or maybe less noise?</td>', 'I''ve seen this idea before but it fits well here.  Good capture of the pages flying by.  Could be a bit sharper or maybe less noise?', '2004-11-24 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030203, 121884, 19936, '<td valign="top">This shot captured my attention immediately.  Great idea and execution!</td>', 'This shot captured my attention immediately.  Great idea and execution!', '2004-11-24 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030224, 122186, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  Although it appears a little washed out I think you must have intended it because it adds to the delineation of the two halves of the face.  Great job.  Oh, you forgot the extra fat deposits and hanging jowls on the older side!  LOL.</td>', 'Very imaginative.  Although it appears a little washed out I think you must have intended it because it adds to the delineation of the two halves of the face.  Great job.  Oh, you forgot the extra fat deposits and hanging jowls on the older side!  LOL.', '2004-11-24 00:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030238, 122433, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good use of emotion, very touching.  Great composition and setup.  Only thing I might want to see different is the ring.  Maybe if it was left b/w the focus would have been only on the connection between the Mom and daughter.  But then again I''m nit-picking.  Great job.</td>', 'Good use of emotion, very touching.  Great composition and setup.  Only thing I might want to see different is the ring.  Maybe if it was left b/w the focus would have been only on the connection between the Mom and daughter.  But then again I''m nit-picking.  Great job.', '2004-11-24 01:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030243, 123023, 19936, '<td valign="top">This struck me as a unique idea and would have worked better with a plain solid (white?) background.  Good imagination though.</td>', 'This struck me as a unique idea and would have worked better with a plain solid (white?) background.  Good imagination though.', '2004-11-24 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030259, 123119, 19936, '<td valign="top">Ah, but his eyes are still bright!  I like the crop but not sure of the 90 degree profile, maybe a 45?  I know, what a nitpick.</td>', 'Ah, but his eyes are still bright!  I like the crop but not sure of the 90 degree profile, maybe a 45?  I know, what a nitpick.', '2004-11-24 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030284, 123040, 19936, '<td valign="top">Some of these shots (sec hand ticking) I rated higher.  Yours appears to suffer from a slight tilt and a loss of definition on the moving second hand.  The ones that did better seemed to capture the hand at each stop.  Good try though and certainly net a low out.  Just average (like most of mine).  Keep plugging away.</td>', 'Some of these shots (sec hand ticking) I rated higher.  Yours appears to suffer from a slight tilt and a loss of definition on the moving second hand.  The ones that did better seemed to capture the hand at each stop.  Good try though and certainly net a low out.  Just average (like most of mine).  Keep plugging away.', '2004-11-24 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030295, 121122, 19936, '<td valign="top">I may be missing something here.  The dripping water is a good idea but I think it is lost in the background.  And I don''t get the difference in focus of the left and right sides.  Keep clicking away though as it may just be me.  Good luck.</td>', 'I may be missing something here.  The dripping water is a good idea but I think it is lost in the background.  And I don''t get the difference in focus of the left and right sides.  Keep clicking away though as it may just be me.  Good luck.', '2004-11-24 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
