(1032841, 122746, 12611, '<td valign="top">This has great elements and a nice composition, at first it seemed a bit too dark- but not really. I like teh yellow tones.<br/></td>', 'This has great elements and a nice composition, at first it seemed a bit too dark- but not really. I like teh yellow tones.', '2004-11-25 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
