(1033261, 123045, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s good - very good. The more I look at it the more I like it! Good luck</td>', 'That''s good - very good. The more I look at it the more I like it! Good luck', '2004-11-26 08:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
