(1033331, 122742, 14671, '<td valign="top">hahahaha  this has to be the funniest photo I''ve seen on here.</td>', 'hahahaha  this has to be the funniest photo I''ve seen on here.', '2004-11-26 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033334, 123166, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find it to be a little to close and really hard to tell what it is.  I like the color and clarity but it might also look better with a border. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I find it to be a little to close and really hard to tell what it is.  I like the color and clarity but it might also look better with a border. <7>', '2004-11-26 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033349, 123130, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the yellow feel of this. nice perspective and composition.</td>', 'I love the yellow feel of this. nice perspective and composition.', '2004-11-26 10:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033350, 123151, 12611, '<td valign="top">a little blue and fuzzy- but its better than a watch shot.</td>', 'a little blue and fuzzy- but its better than a watch shot.', '2004-11-26 10:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033351, 123023, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot- maybe a bit too "symmetric" but I like the figs<br/></td>', 'Nice shot- maybe a bit too "symmetric" but I like the figs', '2004-11-26 10:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033354, 122964, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, Nice subtle tones of the muted greens and yellow. THe top part is  abit ditracting, you would get more emphasis with a low crop.</td>', 'Nice composition, Nice subtle tones of the muted greens and yellow. THe top part is  abit ditracting, you would get more emphasis with a low crop.', '2004-11-26 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033356, 122742, 12611, '<td valign="top">Not my style. A bit too "KItschy" and sanitized. It does however make you scratch your head- so- its ok .</td>', 'Not my style. A bit too "KItschy" and sanitized. It does however make you scratch your head- so- its ok .', '2004-11-26 10:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033357, 122891, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Beautiful orangy red. I like this alot.</td>', 'Nice tones. Beautiful orangy red. I like this alot.', '2004-11-26 10:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033359, 123092, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great concept- I love the blue. Perhaps an alternate shot without the falling petal. but-awesome nonetheless.</td>', 'Great concept- I love the blue. Perhaps an alternate shot without the falling petal. but-awesome nonetheless.', '2004-11-26 10:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033364, 122699, 29948, '<td valign="top">I love that this photo easily fits the theme.  Very nice job.</td>', 'I love that this photo easily fits the theme.  Very nice job.', '2004-11-26 11:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033371, 122887, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait - real sense of character. Not wholly excited about your background, but that''s just personal.</td>', 'Excellent portrait - real sense of character. Not wholly excited about your background, but that''s just personal.', '2004-11-26 11:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033375, 121949, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a ver strong sense of a tilted horizon here - although some of that is an illusion. I''d personally have done something, or gone further, to reduce the difference of light between the building and the sky. A nicely composed image, though - especially like the light on the side of the tower - a shame you couldn''t have caught the whole building in that light. It''s good to see someone shooting at a sensible time of day :-)</td>', 'There''s a ver strong sense of a tilted horizon here - although some of that is an illusion. I''d personally have done something, or gone further, to reduce the difference of light between the building and the sky. A nicely composed image, though - especially like the light on the side of the tower - a shame you couldn''t have caught the whole building in that light. It''s good to see someone shooting at a sensible time of day :-)', '2004-11-26 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033430, 123062, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting perspective...  The gray sky probably helped the exposure (no harsh shadows), but I think the image would have been enhanced with a more dramatic sky.  Still a very good photo.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting perspective...  The gray sky probably helped the exposure (no harsh shadows), but I think the image would have been enhanced with a more dramatic sky.  Still a very good photo.', '2004-11-26 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033476, 123066, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  One thing that would have helped here is if the tree rings were clearly visible.  This can usually only be achieved with sanding.</td>', 'Nice photo.  One thing that would have helped here is if the tree rings were clearly visible.  This can usually only be achieved with sanding.', '2004-11-26 13:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033480, 123037, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but I do not see that the selective desaturation helps the photo.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but I do not see that the selective desaturation helps the photo.', '2004-11-26 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033493, 121892, 21124, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but:<br/>*looks too soft<br/>*is probably too centered, I would have put more space on the right</td>', 'Interesting subject, but:*looks too soft*is probably too centered, I would have put more space on the right', '2004-11-26 14:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033494, 123092, 21124, '<td valign="top">Good photo, unfortunately the compression artifacts are very visibles on this one. This is a 95kB picture, you could have compressed it less.<br/>7</td>', 'Good photo, unfortunately the compression artifacts are very visibles on this one. This is a 95kB picture, you could have compressed it less.7', '2004-11-26 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033495, 122107, 21124, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the colors are quite agressives to me</td>', 'Sorry, but the colors are quite agressives to me', '2004-11-26 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033526, 123036, 20210, '<td valign="top">Feels a little too tightly cropped on top left.  That much gold needs some breathing room to balance the photo.  Otherwise, very effective composition</td>', 'Feels a little too tightly cropped on top left.  That much gold needs some breathing room to balance the photo.  Otherwise, very effective composition', '2004-11-26 15:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033527, 123130, 20210, '<td valign="top">gorgeous photo, doesn''t speak at all to the challenge theme for me, though.</td>', 'gorgeous photo, doesn''t speak at all to the challenge theme for me, though.', '2004-11-26 15:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033659, 123009, 16301, '<td valign="top">Truely illustrates the passing of time. Great tone and depth...</td>', 'Truely illustrates the passing of time. Great tone and depth...', '2004-11-26 18:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033662, 122816, 16301, '<td valign="top">A lady passing over time, creatively observed!</td>', 'A lady passing over time, creatively observed!', '2004-11-26 18:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033664, 122699, 16301, '<td valign="top">wow what a creative idea! I like the selective desat...</td>', 'wow what a creative idea! I like the selective desat...', '2004-11-26 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033703, 123128, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clearly time is passing and it is an intellectually interesting idea, it doesn''t hold my interest as a photograph.</td>', 'Clearly time is passing and it is an intellectually interesting idea, it doesn''t hold my interest as a photograph.', '2004-11-26 19:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033705, 121666, 18197, '<td valign="top">Improbable image. The subject is a bit of a turnoff for me, but getting past that, it would be better without the harsh flash and if the focus were improved.  Comp''s okay.</td>', 'Improbable image. The subject is a bit of a turnoff for me, but getting past that, it would be better without the harsh flash and if the focus were improved.  Comp''s okay.', '2004-11-26 19:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033707, 122107, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image in an Andy Warhol sense. I like the vibrant colors. But I do not get the message of time passing, however.</td>', 'Interesting image in an Andy Warhol sense. I like the vibrant colors. But I do not get the message of time passing, however.', '2004-11-26 19:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033709, 122741, 18197, '<td valign="top">Academically interesting image of a botanical process and subject but it doesn''t resonate with me as an artistic photograph. Subject is weak. Focus needs improvement. White background does a nice job of showing off the subjects but is otherwise uninteresting. This has been done a lot, and the genre doesn''t appeal to me, I guess.</td>', 'Academically interesting image of a botanical process and subject but it doesn''t resonate with me as an artistic photograph. Subject is weak. Focus needs improvement. White background does a nice job of showing off the subjects but is otherwise uninteresting. This has been done a lot, and the genre doesn''t appeal to me, I guess.', '2004-11-26 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033711, 121663, 18197, '<td valign="top">There were an awful lot of ticking clocks. Woody adds a bit of whimsy to an otherwise cliched subject. Bump a couple of points for the humor.</td>', 'There were an awful lot of ticking clocks. Woody adds a bit of whimsy to an otherwise cliched subject. Bump a couple of points for the humor.', '2004-11-26 19:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033715, 122903, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but to me it feels weak in composition. You''ve done a nice job with focus. and I tend to like shallow depth of field, although voters here seem not to.  Levels could use some work. A bit greater saturation of the glasses might add a bit of pizazz. In the end, I am handicapped because I consider crossword puzzles a waste of time and I therefore don''t find the subject all that interesting. I am sure there are uses for this in Stock Photos where the meaning is added through combining the photo with other content. Sorry to seem negative.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but to me it feels weak in composition. You''ve done a nice job with focus. and I tend to like shallow depth of field, although voters here seem not to.  Levels could use some work. A bit greater saturation of the glasses might add a bit of pizazz. In the end, I am handicapped because I consider crossword puzzles a waste of time and I therefore don''t find the subject all that interesting. I am sure there are uses for this in Stock Photos where the meaning is added through combining the photo with other content. Sorry to seem negative.', '2004-11-26 19:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033722, 123101, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sure you have seen the effect of your long title without spaces on the presentation of thumbnails. So I won''t nag you about it. It''s a decent idea for a photo and fits well with the theme. I can imagine that if you had access to a real skeleton this could have been an evocative and creepy photo. As it is, it is a cartoon of a humorous reality for us all. + points for creativity. - points for execution. It did make me smile though.</td>', 'I am sure you have seen the effect of your long title without spaces on the presentation of thumbnails. So I won''t nag you about it. It''s a decent idea for a photo and fits well with the theme. I can imagine that if you had access to a real skeleton this could have been an evocative and creepy photo. As it is, it is a cartoon of a humorous reality for us all. + points for creativity. - points for execution. It did make me smile though.', '2004-11-26 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033726, 122144, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Good execution (at least on the right side focus). There are some distracting artifacts in the overlap on the left. + points for degree of difficulty.</td>', 'Great idea. Good execution (at least on the right side focus). There are some distracting artifacts in the overlap on the left. + points for degree of difficulty.', '2004-11-26 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033727, 122427, 18197, '<td valign="top">This creeps me out. In that sense it does a good job delivering an emotional punch. + points for creativity. - points for composition.</td>', 'This creeps me out. In that sense it does a good job delivering an emotional punch. + points for creativity. - points for composition.', '2004-11-26 19:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033728, 123122, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. + points for creativity, focus, and dynamics. It looks like you tried pretty hard to keep the blue in the frame. I might have cropped it differently to focus more on the top 2/3rds.</td>', 'Interesting idea. + points for creativity, focus, and dynamics. It looks like you tried pretty hard to keep the blue in the frame. I might have cropped it differently to focus more on the top 2/3rds.', '2004-11-26 19:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033731, 121892, 18197, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea! I like the composition and the way you placed the buildings in the frame. It would appeal to me more if it were in razor sharp focus and if I could see a bit more contrast in the land. I didn''t initially like the little bit of sky I can see, but on reflection it helps with context. So I wouldn''t change it but I might try to bring out a bit of detail in the sky (assuming it''s there inthe first place.)</td>', 'GREAT idea! I like the composition and the way you placed the buildings in the frame. It would appeal to me more if it were in razor sharp focus and if I could see a bit more contrast in the land. I didn''t initially like the little bit of sky I can see, but on reflection it helps with context. So I wouldn''t change it but I might try to bring out a bit of detail in the sky (assuming it''s there inthe first place.)', '2004-11-26 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033736, 123083, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea reasonably well composed. I''d like it better if it were bigger. Next time, try using the whole allowed pixel dimension (640). There''s a bit more contrast and saturation than I personally prefer. You have some wide-angle artifacts. Next time, try getting further away and using less of a wide-angle lens setting. All my personal preferences.</td>', 'Good idea reasonably well composed. I''d like it better if it were bigger. Next time, try using the whole allowed pixel dimension (640). There''s a bit more contrast and saturation than I personally prefer. You have some wide-angle artifacts. Next time, try getting further away and using less of a wide-angle lens setting. All my personal preferences.', '2004-11-26 19:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033737, 123042, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like the angle. I don''t get the feeling of time passing, however.</td>', 'Wow, I like the angle. I don''t get the feeling of time passing, however.', '2004-11-26 19:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033738, 123101, 2158, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.</td>', 'Hilarious.', '2004-11-26 19:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033740, 122467, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting low key approach to the subject. It evokes an emotional reaction in me ... run away! I guess fairy tale creatures may have known fear after all.</td>', 'Interesting low key approach to the subject. It evokes an emotional reaction in me ... run away! I guess fairy tale creatures may have known fear after all.', '2004-11-26 19:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033743, 123090, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a case where the photo doesn''t really seem to fit the challenge (at least to my way of thinking) and the title tries to drag it in. Alternatively it is a subject which speaks volumes to you in the context you exist in, but without your context, the photo doesn''t convey to me the same meaning or emotional payload.</td>', 'This is a case where the photo doesn''t really seem to fit the challenge (at least to my way of thinking) and the title tries to drag it in. Alternatively it is a subject which speaks volumes to you in the context you exist in, but without your context, the photo doesn''t convey to me the same meaning or emotional payload.', '2004-11-26 19:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033745, 122999, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I just don''t get it. It is an interesting study in texture. Colors, contrast and levels are fine. Comp''s okay. Great focus. But in the end I see no real relevance to theme and the title doesn''t help me.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I just don''t get it. It is an interesting study in texture. Colors, contrast and levels are fine. Comp''s okay. Great focus. But in the end I see no real relevance to theme and the title doesn''t help me.', '2004-11-26 20:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033747, 121489, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I just don''t get it. It is an interesting city scape at night. Colors, contrast and levels are fine. Comp''s okay. Great focus. But in the end I see no real relevance to theme and the title doesn''t help me.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I just don''t get it. It is an interesting city scape at night. Colors, contrast and levels are fine. Comp''s okay. Great focus. But in the end I see no real relevance to theme and the title doesn''t help me.', '2004-11-26 20:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033749, 122851, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice blossom picture. A bit more contrast in the petals would give it more drama. Weak tie into theme but I get it. Wouldn''t have gotten it without the title.</td>', 'Nice blossom picture. A bit more contrast in the petals would give it more drama. Weak tie into theme but I get it. Wouldn''t have gotten it without the title.', '2004-11-26 20:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033752, 123146, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Seems like a pretty high degree of difficulty. It is probably an artifact of the long exposure that the surface of the water looks unreal ... surreal almost. Very interesting contrast between detail in the top of the photo and time smudged lack of detail in the bottom. Grass in lower left adds interesting counterpoint. Bumping the score.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Seems like a pretty high degree of difficulty. It is probably an artifact of the long exposure that the surface of the water looks unreal ... surreal almost. Very interesting contrast between detail in the top of the photo and time smudged lack of detail in the bottom. Grass in lower left adds interesting counterpoint. Bumping the score.', '2004-11-26 20:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033756, 121203, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea for the challenge. Composition is strong. Feels a bit over processed. I can''t put my finger on it but it has to do with contrast, levels and focus I think. Or possibly the background is over blurred. Sorry, I wish I could be more specific.</td>', 'Very nice idea for the challenge. Composition is strong. Feels a bit over processed. I can''t put my finger on it but it has to do with contrast, levels and focus I think. Or possibly the background is over blurred. Sorry, I wish I could be more specific.', '2004-11-26 20:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033764, 123054, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a WOW photo! But it is the complete anthisis of time passing. Rather it is the briefest of moments frozen in time. ++++ points for creativity, focus, color, DOF. ----- points for relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'This is a WOW photo! But it is the complete anthisis of time passing. Rather it is the briefest of moments frozen in time. ++++ points for creativity, focus, color, DOF. ----- points for relevance to the challenge.', '2004-11-26 20:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033766, 123165, 18197, '<td valign="top">Best of show in my opinion. Color, comp, focus, DOF, shutter speed are all superb. Even the border is okay and I usually hate borders. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Best of show in my opinion. Color, comp, focus, DOF, shutter speed are all superb. Even the border is okay and I usually hate borders. Hope it ribbons.', '2004-11-26 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033769, 122994, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot in spite of the Title. I like the colors, levels and composition (strongest element). The vignette effect isn''t so strong in my opinion. Could be a bit more sharpened. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Very nice shot in spite of the Title. I like the colors, levels and composition (strongest element). The vignette effect isn''t so strong in my opinion. Could be a bit more sharpened. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-26 20:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033774, 123094, 18197, '<td valign="top">One of the few images that really captures the challenge theme. I like the subject, colors, levels, contrast, focus, DOF ... so in that sense it''s virtually flawless. It''s a little dark for my taste. But still among my top picks.</td>', 'One of the few images that really captures the challenge theme. I like the subject, colors, levels, contrast, focus, DOF ... so in that sense it''s virtually flawless. It''s a little dark for my taste. But still among my top picks.', '2004-11-26 20:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033776, 122528, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. First, I confess that I like macro shots very much. This is a great example. I like the way the bend in the rusting metal leads my eye through the picture. The diagonal comp does an effective job dividing the photo into two different zones ... the brighter and higher contrast half and the rustier, lower contrast lower half. Shallow DOF in the lower half exagerates this. Well done. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Very nice. First, I confess that I like macro shots very much. This is a great example. I like the way the bend in the rusting metal leads my eye through the picture. The diagonal comp does an effective job dividing the photo into two different zones ... the brighter and higher contrast half and the rustier, lower contrast lower half. Shallow DOF in the lower half exagerates this. Well done. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-26 20:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033784, 123169, 18197, '<td valign="top">Among my top picks in spite of feeling over sharpened in the foreground. I like that the mast of the sailboat is down. This adds to the sense of time passing. The nostalgic ferry does, too. Not sure whether the fog is real or derives of the mathematics of Gaussian blur, but the blur helps. I live in a part of the US where this is a common site which helps it feel especially pleasing to me. Well done.</td>', 'Among my top picks in spite of feeling over sharpened in the foreground. I like that the mast of the sailboat is down. This adds to the sense of time passing. The nostalgic ferry does, too. Not sure whether the fog is real or derives of the mathematics of Gaussian blur, but the blur helps. I live in a part of the US where this is a common site which helps it feel especially pleasing to me. Well done.', '2004-11-26 20:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033785, 123096, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great nostalgic decay photo. Well done. Among my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'Great nostalgic decay photo. Well done. Among my top picks this challenge.', '2004-11-26 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033787, 122960, 18197, '<td valign="top">A startling image. I like that his body is hidden in shadow and the toddler is completely visible. The shallow DOF field contributes to this. Good job. Hope it does well inthe voting. Is he wearing a clerical collar? That would add a whole ''nother dimension to this in light of current news!</td>', 'A startling image. I like that his body is hidden in shadow and the toddler is completely visible. The shallow DOF field contributes to this. Good job. Hope it does well inthe voting. Is he wearing a clerical collar? That would add a whole ''nother dimension to this in light of current news!', '2004-11-26 20:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033790, 123062, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the Water Tower area of Chicago and this is among the best pictures I''ve seen of it. Great capture. I especially like the white areas to the right and at the top. They set off the subject well. The counter point of modern and old works well. Good job.</td>', 'I like the Water Tower area of Chicago and this is among the best pictures I''ve seen of it. Great capture. I especially like the white areas to the right and at the top. They set off the subject well. The counter point of modern and old works well. Good job.', '2004-11-26 20:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033792, 123160, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I like very much that your reversed Time Passing and took a "passing time" approach. ++ for creativity. I am generally a fan of shallow DOF but in this case it is too shallow for my taste. Just me, so don''t worry about it. I am also a fan of color ("If God had wanted us to shoot B&amp;W, he wouldn''t have invented Kodachrome.") It would be interesting to see this in color. Good job. Keep it up!</td>', 'Good idea. I like very much that your reversed Time Passing and took a "passing time" approach. ++ for creativity. I am generally a fan of shallow DOF but in this case it is too shallow for my taste. Just me, so don''t worry about it. I am also a fan of color ("If God had wanted us to shoot B&W, he wouldn''t have invented Kodachrome.") It would be interesting to see this in color. Good job. Keep it up!', '2004-11-26 20:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033794, 123032, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is possibly the best subject I can think of for the challenge. I would love to see a macro shot of the rings, possibly where they break into cracks and fissures in the wood.</td>', 'This is possibly the best subject I can think of for the challenge. I would love to see a macro shot of the rings, possibly where they break into cracks and fissures in the wood.', '2004-11-26 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033827, 123018, 29945, '<td valign="top">I can see the "liitle girl" nice composotion too!</td>', 'I can see the "liitle girl" nice composotion too!', '2004-11-26 21:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
