(1033910, 123003, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating picture. A true study in aging. The eyes still have the same intensity but probably quite a bit wiser! Great interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'What a fascinating picture. A true study in aging. The eyes still have the same intensity but probably quite a bit wiser! Great interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-11-26 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033911, 122699, 27847, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, that''s amazing and very nice B&amp;W/Color mixture. You must have spent a lot of time on setup well worth it and I''m sure your reaping the rewards.  Great Job.</td>', 'Excellent capture, that''s amazing and very nice B&W/Color mixture. You must have spent a lot of time on setup well worth it and I''m sure your reaping the rewards.  Great Job.', '2004-11-26 22:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033937, 123106, 27847, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, the more I look at it the more I like it. Great Job</td>', 'Interesting photo, the more I look at it the more I like it. Great Job', '2004-11-26 23:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033938, 122983, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. Love the concept and I must say I have never drank half my glass quite that way. Great shot.</td>', 'Very cool photo. Love the concept and I must say I have never drank half my glass quite that way. Great shot.', '2004-11-26 23:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033941, 123003, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great Photo, I really like it. The left hand face looks a little washed out (probably because that''s a printed photo), still liek the whole concept. Hopefully it does well.</td>', 'Great Photo, I really like it. The left hand face looks a little washed out (probably because that''s a printed photo), still liek the whole concept. Hopefully it does well.', '2004-11-26 23:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033947, 123092, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent setup for this challenge and I love the color treatment. My only feedback is that the rose looks a bit too sharpened and, if I''m being very picky, would look better leaning over a little to the right. Still, this is a really nice image - one of my favorite in the challenge. Great job.</td>', 'This is an excellent setup for this challenge and I love the color treatment. My only feedback is that the rose looks a bit too sharpened and, if I''m being very picky, would look better leaning over a little to the right. Still, this is a really nice image - one of my favorite in the challenge. Great job.', '2004-11-27 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033949, 122951, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is just a beautiful shot and perfect for this challenge. The composition, timing, and exposure are all outstanding. Great job.</td>', 'This is just a beautiful shot and perfect for this challenge. The composition, timing, and exposure are all outstanding. Great job.', '2004-11-27 00:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033950, 123002, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great composition and an excellent subject for this challenge. I think the shot might look better with a bit more contrast, but that''s being very picky. Very nice job!</td>', 'Great composition and an excellent subject for this challenge. I think the shot might look better with a bit more contrast, but that''s being very picky. Very nice job!', '2004-11-27 00:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033952, 122909, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great setup for this challenge and I really like the lighting. Very nice job.</td>', 'This is a great setup for this challenge and I really like the lighting. Very nice job.', '2004-11-27 00:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033953, 123015, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great detail, lighting and composition. Really nice job.</td>', 'Great detail, lighting and composition. Really nice job.', '2004-11-27 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033955, 123003, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The cloudiness around both heads is a bit distracting, but this is such an excellent shot for this challenge that really tells a nice, emotional story. Great job.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The cloudiness around both heads is a bit distracting, but this is such an excellent shot for this challenge that really tells a nice, emotional story. Great job.', '2004-11-27 00:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033956, 122983, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea for this theme and a good job of execution. Really nice shot.</td>', 'Very cool idea for this theme and a good job of execution. Really nice shot.', '2004-11-27 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033957, 122699, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup and an excellent subject for desaturation. Really good job.</td>', 'Very nice setup and an excellent subject for desaturation. Really good job.', '2004-11-27 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033958, 123091, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and your framing/composition look great. Very nice job.</td>', 'I really like this shot and your framing/composition look great. Very nice job.', '2004-11-27 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033959, 122742, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very clever setup and a well executed shot. The colors look great together. Really nice job.</td>', 'Very clever setup and a well executed shot. The colors look great together. Really nice job.', '2004-11-27 00:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033979, 123166, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and I love the crop. Just enough water to show time passing at the same time not too much to take our mind off what you were trying to achieve. I believe that is called great composition. Not much more I can say other than Great Job!</td>', 'Nice tones and I love the crop. Just enough water to show time passing at the same time not too much to take our mind off what you were trying to achieve. I believe that is called great composition. Not much more I can say other than Great Job!', '2004-11-27 02:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033980, 122742, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph is well thought out and very creative. The border gives me a feel of looking at a slide film. Great Job!</td>', 'Your photograph is well thought out and very creative. The border gives me a feel of looking at a slide film. Great Job!', '2004-11-27 02:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034013, 123064, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this - especially the dark tones of the stones, coupled with the weathering of the boarding of the building. I find your choice of point of view a bit odd - mainly where the ttree overlaps the building - rather that it just leaves that small edge of it still showing: it doesn''t quite work compositionally, though quite what I''d recommend instead I don''t know. Strong image, nevertheless.</td>', 'I like this - especially the dark tones of the stones, coupled with the weathering of the boarding of the building. I find your choice of point of view a bit odd - mainly where the ttree overlaps the building - rather that it just leaves that small edge of it still showing: it doesn''t quite work compositionally, though quite what I''d recommend instead I don''t know. Strong image, nevertheless.', '2004-11-27 04:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034014, 121203, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the approach tremendously - your processing has achieved that sense of an aged shot very well - has the feel of a early 20th century traveller''s shot. Really like the composition too. Subtle, graceful.</td>', 'Like the approach tremendously - your processing has achieved that sense of an aged shot very well - has the feel of a early 20th century traveller''s shot. Really like the composition too. Subtle, graceful.', '2004-11-27 04:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034015, 122744, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good high-key work - thank god you haven''t gone for the ''perfectly'' white background which is so annoying to the eye. I can''t say I like the composition of subject very much - though it does have a strong element of recession to it, I think it has become too complicated; my temptation would be to have lined them up more, use a stronger diagonal composition ... but I''m not certain that would work any better :-) A pretty common subject approach too.</td>', 'Good high-key work - thank god you haven''t gone for the ''perfectly'' white background which is so annoying to the eye. I can''t say I like the composition of subject very much - though it does have a strong element of recession to it, I think it has become too complicated; my temptation would be to have lined them up more, use a stronger diagonal composition ... but I''m not certain that would work any better :-) A pretty common subject approach too.', '2004-11-27 04:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034017, 122851, 6999, '<td valign="top">This strong composition is just a touch let down by that semi-focussed stalk image left - adds a touch of confusion to the visual progression through your three subjects. Good colour - perhaps the yellows on the flower are just a fraction over-done? I feel that some areas have lost detail. Neat approach to the challenge though.</td>', 'This strong composition is just a touch let down by that semi-focussed stalk image left - adds a touch of confusion to the visual progression through your three subjects. Good colour - perhaps the yellows on the flower are just a fraction over-done? I feel that some areas have lost detail. Neat approach to the challenge though.', '2004-11-27 04:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034018, 123078, 6999, '<td valign="top">A clear technical meeting of the challenge - no, that doesn''t read like I mean it (it''s a compliment). I mean that the element of passing time is a camera-relevant one, rather than subject-based. I love that you haven''t gone to black for your background. I love the intent of this too. Great shot, I hope it does wildly better than I expect it to ;-)</td>', 'A clear technical meeting of the challenge - no, that doesn''t read like I mean it (it''s a compliment). I mean that the element of passing time is a camera-relevant one, rather than subject-based. I love that you haven''t gone to black for your background. I love the intent of this too. Great shot, I hope it does wildly better than I expect it to ;-)', '2004-11-27 04:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034020, 122742, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very clever; can''t say it does much for me photographically. I wonder if you haven''t sacrificed a sense of depth and power of light in the process of the trick.</td>', 'Very clever; can''t say it does much for me photographically. I wonder if you haven''t sacrificed a sense of depth and power of light in the process of the trick.', '2004-11-27 04:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034023, 122956, 6999, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent study - like the background progression of light: really adds that little interest to the negative space, and pulls the eye to the subject. (I''ve used background light like this myself, and usually been knocked in comments for it - intrigued to know if you''re getting something similar). Strong sense of texture on the wood. Just the slightest sense (and it''s more significant in such a contrlled an simple image) of too much sharpening in some edges of the wood - top right especially.</td>', 'Technically excellent study - like the background progression of light: really adds that little interest to the negative space, and pulls the eye to the subject. (I''ve used background light like this myself, and usually been knocked in comments for it - intrigued to know if you''re getting something similar). Strong sense of texture on the wood. Just the slightest sense (and it''s more significant in such a contrlled an simple image) of too much sharpening in some edges of the wood - top right especially.', '2004-11-27 04:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034026, 122994, 5354, '<td valign="top">There appears to be a strange darkness in the corners, not sure if that is intended or just  a problem with the lens. However, I don''t find it adds anything positive to the image</td>', 'There appears to be a strange darkness in the corners, not sure if that is intended or just  a problem with the lens. However, I don''t find it adds anything positive to the image', '2004-11-27 05:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034027, 123037, 5354, '<td valign="top">Strange white artifacts around the guy. I think your selection is not quite accurate. Shame, because the idea is pretty good.</td>', 'Strange white artifacts around the guy. I think your selection is not quite accurate. Shame, because the idea is pretty good.', '2004-11-27 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034055, 122994, 25787, '<td valign="top">A little vignetted...was it intentional?  Building a little tilted.  Just being picky. I like it a lot.</td>', 'A little vignetted...was it intentional?  Building a little tilted.  Just being picky. I like it a lot.', '2004-11-27 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034056, 122699, 25787, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2004-11-27 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034068, 121732, 6999, '<td valign="top">A slightly too lengthy exposure? Only slightly - just enough for the water to seem not properly focussed: not enough to be blurred exactly, but certainly without the crispness of sharp focus. As the rock silhouette seems OK, it almost has to be motion blur. I''m also not sure about the way you''ve placed the horizon relative to the rocks.</td>', 'A slightly too lengthy exposure? Only slightly - just enough for the water to seem not properly focussed: not enough to be blurred exactly, but certainly without the crispness of sharp focus. As the rock silhouette seems OK, it almost has to be motion blur. I''m also not sure about the way you''ve placed the horizon relative to the rocks.', '2004-11-27 09:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034070, 122367, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think this needs a softness of light, and of direction of light, that you haven''t achieved: this way leaves all the skin seeming quite shiny and ugly. The composition also seems quite threatening - i''m not sure that''s what you intend. The adult fist being closed over those small fingers speaks more of enclosure, of suffocation, than of gentleness. I don''t know - maybe you intended a more sinister image - it would be unusual for a challenge entry for sure, and it''s hard to be certain.</td>', 'I think this needs a softness of light, and of direction of light, that you haven''t achieved: this way leaves all the skin seeming quite shiny and ugly. The composition also seems quite threatening - i''m not sure that''s what you intend. The adult fist being closed over those small fingers speaks more of enclosure, of suffocation, than of gentleness. I don''t know - maybe you intended a more sinister image - it would be unusual for a challenge entry for sure, and it''s hard to be certain.', '2004-11-27 09:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034072, 123113, 6999, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that this is as big a file as you could enter, but nevertheless I think the jpeg artefacts present - certainly around the smaller cogs and dials, and in the intense red and green colours - cause more sense of confucion than of anything else. Quite strange in all - just not, I''m afriad, in a way that particularly appeals here.</td>', 'I appreciate that this is as big a file as you could enter, but nevertheless I think the jpeg artefacts present - certainly around the smaller cogs and dials, and in the intense red and green colours - cause more sense of confucion than of anything else. Quite strange in all - just not, I''m afriad, in a way that particularly appeals here.', '2004-11-27 09:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034074, 121205, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, strong sense of dark, like the stars. A couple of things, which i think matter in such a simple composition: the break in the white trails, and the white spot extreme left: I would certainly have cloned them out myself. But an impressive go at a pretty common type of image, all the same.</td>', 'Excellent composition, strong sense of dark, like the stars. A couple of things, which i think matter in such a simple composition: the break in the white trails, and the white spot extreme left: I would certainly have cloned them out myself. But an impressive go at a pretty common type of image, all the same.', '2004-11-27 09:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034075, 122983, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed trick - though I''m not certain about your light: seems quie heavy - the reflections so very bright, but the subjects seeming a touch indistinct. Pity you couldn''t have got the glass more precisely half and half - I think these kinds of trick work really do need care in such areas.</td>', 'Nicely executed trick - though I''m not certain about your light: seems quie heavy - the reflections so very bright, but the subjects seeming a touch indistinct. Pity you couldn''t have got the glass more precisely half and half - I think these kinds of trick work really do need care in such areas.', '2004-11-27 10:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034080, 121860, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite apart from the sharpening artefacts around the numbers and face markings, it is the scratches and disorganised reflections in the face surround that most let this image down for me: they remove from the clean lines, the stylishness of the image, but yet there doesn''t seem to be an age factor, a history, a story of use that you''re communicating here. The composition of the circle of the face in the frame is strong - not an easy thing to get right - and the positions of the hands and movements of them are clear.</td>', 'Quite apart from the sharpening artefacts around the numbers and face markings, it is the scratches and disorganised reflections in the face surround that most let this image down for me: they remove from the clean lines, the stylishness of the image, but yet there doesn''t seem to be an age factor, a history, a story of use that you''re communicating here. The composition of the circle of the face in the frame is strong - not an easy thing to get right - and the positions of the hands and movements of them are clear.', '2004-11-27 10:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034082, 123020, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat, careful, good use of colour. Taking the colour so very far away from black I think works to give the image that neon punch, though the obvious downside of it is to stifle any strong sense of depth. Not sure about it, in the end.</td>', 'Neat, careful, good use of colour. Taking the colour so very far away from black I think works to give the image that neon punch, though the obvious downside of it is to stifle any strong sense of depth. Not sure about it, in the end.', '2004-11-27 10:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034084, 123115, 6999, '<td valign="top">Carefully done, indeed. Feels a touch over-posed for me: there''s little realistic about tthe placing of the pencil, nor the hyper-sharpness of it. I get what you were heading for, I think, but for me it turns it into a simply posed image, rather than anything particularly communicative.</td>', 'Carefully done, indeed. Feels a touch over-posed for me: there''s little realistic about tthe placing of the pencil, nor the hyper-sharpness of it. I get what you were heading for, I think, but for me it turns it into a simply posed image, rather than anything particularly communicative.', '2004-11-27 10:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034085, 122983, 2223, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to hear how this was done! Very fascinating. 10</td>', 'Can''t wait to hear how this was done! Very fascinating. 10', '2004-11-27 10:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034086, 123062, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst I like the way you''ve fitted these into your frame, I eally do find the completely burrnt-out sky more of an annoyance than a useful contribution: the image becomes almost more about that white shape than about the architecture.</td>', 'Whilst I like the way you''ve fitted these into your frame, I eally do find the completely burrnt-out sky more of an annoyance than a useful contribution: the image becomes almost more about that white shape than about the architecture.', '2004-11-27 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034088, 123122, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing effect - haven''t a clue what you''ve done: my first impression is that it was a cold egg, but I guess it could be a lengthy exposure. I quite like those patterns in the fat, and your use of colour is strong ... but I think too much of the interest is about whay you''ve done in shooting, rather than in the final result of that.</td>', 'Intriguing effect - haven''t a clue what you''ve done: my first impression is that it was a cold egg, but I guess it could be a lengthy exposure. I quite like those patterns in the fat, and your use of colour is strong ... but I think too much of the interest is about whay you''ve done in shooting, rather than in the final result of that.', '2004-11-27 10:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034090, 122960, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find those over-blown highlights a major distraction here. Fixable, I wold hope, as it''s a very strong portrait in potential.</td>', 'I find those over-blown highlights a major distraction here. Fixable, I wold hope, as it''s a very strong portrait in potential.', '2004-11-27 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034091, 122893, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong greens, and good detailing therein. As far as a challenge entry is concerned, I think it lacks a strong sense of definite subject - there are too many areas that might draw the eye for the quqickly passing voter. It has a sense of stillness, though, which is quite appealing.</td>', 'Strong greens, and good detailing therein. As far as a challenge entry is concerned, I think it lacks a strong sense of definite subject - there are too many areas that might draw the eye for the quqickly passing voter. It has a sense of stillness, though, which is quite appealing.', '2004-11-27 10:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034093, 122903, 6999, '<td valign="top">Aside from meeting the challenge by the straightforward expdient of putting the words in the shot - and the more genuine sense of the challenge by it being a shot of a crossword - I find this a slightly uncomfortable image. The differentiation between whites and greys seems overly definite, rather than progressive, and your composition places odd things in the strong areas of frame - the ''passing time'' is releggated from visual interest by being so far toward the edge. I think many voters will simply see a crossword shot.</td>', 'Aside from meeting the challenge by the straightforward expdient of putting the words in the shot - and the more genuine sense of the challenge by it being a shot of a crossword - I find this a slightly uncomfortable image. The differentiation between whites and greys seems overly definite, rather than progressive, and your composition places odd things in the strong areas of frame - the ''passing time'' is releggated from visual interest by being so far toward the edge. I think many voters will simply see a crossword shot.', '2004-11-27 10:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034097, 121935, 6999, '<td valign="top">The old building seems almost incidental to this shot; try it: as you focus on it, your eye is constantly pulled toward the bright areas of sky toward the top of the image. There''s little real detail either:I really want to be able to see the signs of ageing in the wood, but because of the flat light it''s in all that texture just isn''t visible. I''m not sure what one would do to fix it - a different light would be the obvious thing, but is that possible? Perhaps if there were a time of day when the light slanted in through that break in the trees to illuminate the old shed more than the surrounding trees? Either that, or consider tthe approach of a close-up on the broken down areas of the wood. The encroachment of the trees toward the shed is obviously a good point to make re the challenge, but I think you''ve sacrificed a properly communicative image just to get that element.</td>', 'The old building seems almost incidental to this shot; try it: as you focus on it, your eye is constantly pulled toward the bright areas of sky toward the top of the image. There''s little real detail either:I really want to be able to see the signs of ageing in the wood, but because of the flat light it''s in all that texture just isn''t visible. I''m not sure what one would do to fix it - a different light would be the obvious thing, but is that possible? Perhaps if there were a time of day when the light slanted in through that break in the trees to illuminate the old shed more than the surrounding trees? Either that, or consider tthe approach of a close-up on the broken down areas of the wood. The encroachment of the trees toward the shed is obviously a good point to make re the challenge, but I think you''ve sacrificed a properly communicative image just to get that element.', '2004-11-27 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034102, 123086, 6999, '<td valign="top">What a wondefully strange, marvellous image. I really wish the side of that bag wasn''t so far over-exposed. Great sense of the ordinary, beautifully communicated in the absolutely ''normal'' colour palette you''ve used. Everso expressive - very strong work. I hope others understand it, or at least give it the time.</td>', 'What a wondefully strange, marvellous image. I really wish the side of that bag wasn''t so far over-exposed. Great sense of the ordinary, beautifully communicated in the absolutely ''normal'' colour palette you''ve used. Everso expressive - very strong work. I hope others understand it, or at least give it the time.', '2004-11-27 10:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034103, 122427, 6999, '<td valign="top">Crazy. Don''t know what else to say. Hate the direct flash, composition and idea just bizarre :-)</td>', 'Crazy. Don''t know what else to say. Hate the direct flash, composition and idea just bizarre :-)', '2004-11-27 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034104, 123091, 8139, '<td valign="top">I like this much. Stong photo.</td>', 'I like this much. Stong photo.', '2004-11-27 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034106, 123002, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very aestetic composition, fits well the theme. Nice toning.</td>', 'Very aestetic composition, fits well the theme. Nice toning.', '2004-11-27 10:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034111, 121122, 6999, '<td valign="top">It feels that you''ve placed your focal plane too far into the image: surely the focus should be more strongly on the ice and drop, whereas it seems to be behind it to my eye.</td>', 'It feels that you''ve placed your focal plane too far into the image: surely the focus should be more strongly on the ice and drop, whereas it seems to be behind it to my eye.', '2004-11-27 10:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034112, 123081, 6999, '<td valign="top">The light trails, compositionally are strong; I''m not sure about the other lights around - they seem to clutter what might be stronger for being a very simple image.</td>', 'The light trails, compositionally are strong; I''m not sure about the other lights around - they seem to clutter what might be stronger for being a very simple image.', '2004-11-27 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034115, 121203, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is just fantastic--10</td>', 'This is just fantastic--10', '2004-11-27 10:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034117, 122983, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot--I think I know how you did but look forward to reading your comments after the competition</td>', 'This is a great shot--I think I know how you did but look forward to reading your comments after the competition', '2004-11-27 10:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034119, 122433, 20115, '<td valign="top">this is lovely but I don''t like the gold ring.  The saturation gives it emhasis and I don''t see how that matters in this competition of time passing--the hands together handle that nicely.</td>', 'this is lovely but I don''t like the gold ring.  The saturation gives it emhasis and I don''t see how that matters in this competition of time passing--the hands together handle that nicely.', '2004-11-27 11:00:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1034120, 123101, 20115, '<td valign="top">gave me a good laugh</td>', 'gave me a good laugh', '2004-11-27 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034207, 122742, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very Nicely Done. BradP would be proud of the framing ;-) Love the picture.</td>', 'Very Nicely Done. BradP would be proud of the framing ;-) Love the picture.', '2004-11-27 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034209, 123099, 16488, '<td valign="top">A classic beauty.  The sepia lends to your interpretation of the challenge.  With the trail o the watch was more defined, it''s lost against the light background.  Perhaps a shorter exposure with only half the arc recorded stopping the pocket watch in mid-air?  Use of frame was probably necessary, this one is a bit heavy-handed though.</td>', 'A classic beauty.  The sepia lends to your interpretation of the challenge.  With the trail o the watch was more defined, it''s lost against the light background.  Perhaps a shorter exposure with only half the arc recorded stopping the pocket watch in mid-air?  Use of frame was probably necessary, this one is a bit heavy-handed though.', '2004-11-27 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034210, 122367, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice and a timeless pose.  The gentle coloring adds nicely to the whole.  Two things that would make it better (in my opinion), a tighter crop to eliminate the distracting background on the right and cleaner fingernails on the child''s hand.</td>', 'Nice and a timeless pose.  The gentle coloring adds nicely to the whole.  Two things that would make it better (in my opinion), a tighter crop to eliminate the distracting background on the right and cleaner fingernails on the child''s hand.', '2004-11-27 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034212, 122430, 16488, '<td valign="top">This really pops!  Love the almost symetry of the trees.  Would make a lovely print!</td>', 'This really pops!  Love the almost symetry of the trees.  Would make a lovely print!', '2004-11-27 12:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034216, 122437, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting light-trails in this.  The centered composition gives the sense of one thing not changing while all around it is a busy chaos.  Just nice!</td>', 'Interesting light-trails in this.  The centered composition gives the sense of one thing not changing while all around it is a busy chaos.  Just nice!', '2004-11-27 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034222, 123054, 16488, '<td valign="top">The colors of this are a real attention grabber!   But what really gets me everytime I look at this is the elephant looking straight back (and no, I don''t see a pink one)...I hope you can find it since it''s difficult to explain where it is.  Interesting photo!</td>', 'The colors of this are a real attention grabber!   But what really gets me everytime I look at this is the elephant looking straight back (and no, I don''t see a pink one)...I hope you can find it since it''s difficult to explain where it is.  Interesting photo!', '2004-11-27 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034258, 123047, 16488, '<td valign="top">I really like your treatment of the subject with the sepia and romantic blur.  Something about the composition gives it a portrait quality.</td>', 'I really like your treatment of the subject with the sepia and romantic blur.  Something about the composition gives it a portrait quality.', '2004-11-27 13:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034259, 123030, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture.  Something about the composition leaves me wanting....perhaps its because the wide angle seems to pull the windows apart and creates an arching at the top of the frame.  Worthy subject, though.</td>', 'Wonderful texture.  Something about the composition leaves me wanting....perhaps its because the wide angle seems to pull the windows apart and creates an arching at the top of the frame.  Worthy subject, though.', '2004-11-27 13:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034260, 122742, 16488, '<td valign="top">It seems the days of the triptych by framing are here.  Interesting application of the technique, nonetheless.  Seems the center glass and cookie are not quite as crisply in focus as the others--the lighting differences suggests it was set back a hair deeper.  Looking forward to the explanation of how you got the Oreos to stand up in the milk.</td>', 'It seems the days of the triptych by framing are here.  Interesting application of the technique, nonetheless.  Seems the center glass and cookie are not quite as crisply in focus as the others--the lighting differences suggests it was set back a hair deeper.  Looking forward to the explanation of how you got the Oreos to stand up in the milk.', '2004-11-27 14:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034262, 122741, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice progression of leaves.  The composition doesn''t hold me, though.  Maybe it''s just that the white void leaves them floating but without conveying a reason.  Interesting study.</td>', 'Nice progression of leaves.  The composition doesn''t hold me, though.  Maybe it''s just that the white void leaves them floating but without conveying a reason.  Interesting study.', '2004-11-27 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034263, 122699, 29280, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for this one, and think you pulled it off well. The subjects are excellent too.</td>', 'I really like the idea for this one, and think you pulled it off well. The subjects are excellent too.', '2004-11-27 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034268, 123122, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstraction.  I like the contrast of textures between the foreground pot and the bubling water.  The water seems almost "hard" because fof the stop-motion--it makes the egg appear to be under a harsh, cutting influence.  Something about this holds my fascination.</td>', 'Interesting abstraction.  I like the contrast of textures between the foreground pot and the bubling water.  The water seems almost "hard" because fof the stop-motion--it makes the egg appear to be under a harsh, cutting influence.  Something about this holds my fascination.', '2004-11-27 14:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034270, 123165, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely close-up.  It seems it could be a tad more symmetrical and perhaps have a crisper line somewhere.</td>', 'Lovely close-up.  It seems it could be a tad more symmetrical and perhaps have a crisper line somewhere.', '2004-11-27 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034273, 123054, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like the kiwi shaped hole in the water.</td>', 'I really like the kiwi shaped hole in the water.', '2004-11-27 14:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034275, 123165, 29280, '<td valign="top">heh, I was recently trying to take a shot like this, though not for this challenge. I think you pulled it off well, and I think the macro nature of it makes it stand out much more than including more of the glass. Nice job!</td>', 'heh, I was recently trying to take a shot like this, though not for this challenge. I think you pulled it off well, and I think the macro nature of it makes it stand out much more than including more of the glass. Nice job!', '2004-11-27 14:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034279, 123078, 29280, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get this photo based on the title. There''s nothing that makes me interested in the light and it feels a bit too random for my tastes.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get this photo based on the title. There''s nothing that makes me interested in the light and it feels a bit too random for my tastes.', '2004-11-27 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034282, 121666, 29280, '<td valign="top">I know it may not have been appropriate otherwise, but the wearing of the boxer shorts throws this one off and makes it just seem like a posed attempt to create something. The idea is pretty fun, but I think with a little more creativity I could "believe" it more.</td>', 'I know it may not have been appropriate otherwise, but the wearing of the boxer shorts throws this one off and makes it just seem like a posed attempt to create something. The idea is pretty fun, but I think with a little more creativity I could "believe" it more.', '2004-11-27 14:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034286, 122952, 29280, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more emphasis on the subject of this shot rather than including all of the people in the background looking on as well.</td>', 'I would like to see more emphasis on the subject of this shot rather than including all of the people in the background looking on as well.', '2004-11-27 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034295, 122186, 24494, '<td valign="top">great shot 10 did you make this poor man dye half of his hair? great idea though</td>', 'great shot 10 did you make this poor man dye half of his hair? great idea though', '2004-11-27 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034320, 121489, 16488, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the light in this picture.  It would be nice, as far as the challenge theme goes, if the plane was farther into the picture with a longer vapor trail.  Nice idea.</td>', 'I really enjoy the light in this picture.  It would be nice, as far as the challenge theme goes, if the plane was farther into the picture with a longer vapor trail.  Nice idea.', '2004-11-27 15:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034325, 123015, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a lovely palette of color!  The lighting draws out the texture so nicely.  Crisp and well-composed!  It would be a smidge nicer, even, if the dusty hairs on the leave in the center were not present.  Otherwise, sweet!</td>', 'What a lovely palette of color!  The lighting draws out the texture so nicely.  Crisp and well-composed!  It would be a smidge nicer, even, if the dusty hairs on the leave in the center were not present.  Otherwise, sweet!', '2004-11-27 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034326, 123053, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract.  Wish it were shot complete straight on and all bits were perfectly in focus.  Great find!</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract.  Wish it were shot complete straight on and all bits were perfectly in focus.  Great find!', '2004-11-27 15:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034346, 123169, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely image!   The bouys lead the eye into the composition.  What a pretty and quiet shot!  For me, it''s not a perfect fit with the challenge theme, it seems more like time stopped than passing.  The small boat appears oversharp, a problem with these small files perhaps.  Would make a very nice print, nonetheless!</td>', 'Lovely image!   The bouys lead the eye into the composition.  What a pretty and quiet shot!  For me, it''s not a perfect fit with the challenge theme, it seems more like time stopped than passing.  The small boat appears oversharp, a problem with these small files perhaps.  Would make a very nice print, nonetheless!', '2004-11-27 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034348, 123042, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the concept for the challenge--a well chosen subject.  Unfortunately, the extreme angle makes the whole "lie down" a bit much--just feels awkward to me.  Beautiful colors in this limited palette!</td>', 'I like the concept for the challenge--a well chosen subject.  Unfortunately, the extreme angle makes the whole "lie down" a bit much--just feels awkward to me.  Beautiful colors in this limited palette!', '2004-11-27 15:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034351, 123023, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty quality of your subject...nicely contrasted against the ever-new whiteness of the bowl.  The background, however, is a distraction to me...the color and definition of the wood keeps pulling my eye away.  Perhaps something more neutral would have worked better.</td>', 'I like the gritty quality of your subject...nicely contrasted against the ever-new whiteness of the bowl.  The background, however, is a distraction to me...the color and definition of the wood keeps pulling my eye away.  Perhaps something more neutral would have worked better.', '2004-11-27 16:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034353, 123045, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost non-pnotographic in its quality. The overlap of the hour hand is intriguing. I like it, I like the bordering and presentation generally. Neat, and controlled.</td>', 'Almost non-pnotographic in its quality. The overlap of the hour hand is intriguing. I like it, I like the bordering and presentation generally. Neat, and controlled.', '2004-11-27 16:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034355, 123153, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good subject, without doubt. Your photograph - well, it''s almost hyper-documentary in style - it is, to me, more about a simple capture of the entirety of the truck and its location, including as much detail as possible, than it is about communicating anything of your own feeling about it. That may well be your choice - inwhich case you''ve absolutely achieved it - but perhaps it is not the way to score well here. All the technical detail is there, but I would have preferred more of an attitude to be taken to it, rather than this simple representation.</td>', 'Good subject, without doubt. Your photograph - well, it''s almost hyper-documentary in style - it is, to me, more about a simple capture of the entirety of the truck and its location, including as much detail as possible, than it is about communicating anything of your own feeling about it. That may well be your choice - inwhich case you''ve absolutely achieved it - but perhaps it is not the way to score well here. All the technical detail is there, but I would have preferred more of an attitude to be taken to it, rather than this simple representation.', '2004-11-27 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034359, 122886, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good subject. The presentation of it is reminiscent of some of the modern ''suburban'' school of photography (my term) - those guys who are using the colour scemes and ''simplistic'' methodology of the 1970''s snp-shot: on-board flash, heavy saturation, disdain for some rules. I like the metallicism of the tap, the reds and browns in the tree ... but its not a school of photography that particularly appeals to me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Good subject. The presentation of it is reminiscent of some of the modern ''suburban'' school of photography (my term) - those guys who are using the colour scemes and ''simplistic'' methodology of the 1970''s snp-shot: on-board flash, heavy saturation, disdain for some rules. I like the metallicism of the tap, the reds and browns in the tree ... but its not a school of photography that particularly appeals to me, I''m afraid.', '2004-11-27 16:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034364, 123047, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are a number of things I like about this: that sense of soft-focus, which chimes with a common perception of ''old'' photography; a strong sense of the textures and details produced by ageing; strong compositional principles, and a strong balance of interest. Wha it communicates to me - and what, I''m afraid, i don''t like about it - is that there''s some kind of glory in that previous age, that its decay and left-overs, that so blight our present (and to be fair, that our present is currently bequeathing to our future), is really rather pretty and lovely, rather than sinister and regrettable, which to my mind is the more apt reaction. Great shot, with that reservation.</td>', 'There are a number of things I like about this: that sense of soft-focus, which chimes with a common perception of ''old'' photography; a strong sense of the textures and details produced by ageing; strong compositional principles, and a strong balance of interest. Wha it communicates to me - and what, I''m afraid, i don''t like about it - is that there''s some kind of glory in that previous age, that its decay and left-overs, that so blight our present (and to be fair, that our present is currently bequeathing to our future), is really rather pretty and lovely, rather than sinister and regrettable, which to my mind is the more apt reaction. Great shot, with that reservation.', '2004-11-27 16:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034369, 123027, 6999, '<td valign="top">Complex, emotional, and realistic. Those dates encompass my birthday, as they encompass, of course, the ''summer of love'', ironically enough. Strong subject, and I wish you a better score than I''m sure you''ll get.</td>', 'Complex, emotional, and realistic. Those dates encompass my birthday, as they encompass, of course, the ''summer of love'', ironically enough. Strong subject, and I wish you a better score than I''m sure you''ll get.', '2004-11-27 16:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034396, 121666, 12017, '<td valign="top">wow...you use the john with your boxers on....?</td>', 'wow...you use the john with your boxers on....?', '2004-11-27 16:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034421, 123042, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are quality issues with this - for all the world, it looks like a 100% crop out of camera. I like the tonality of it, and kind of like the odd angel you''ve presented. But it lacks the detail, or sense of detail.</td>', 'There are quality issues with this - for all the world, it looks like a 100% crop out of camera. I like the tonality of it, and kind of like the odd angel you''ve presented. But it lacks the detail, or sense of detail.', '2004-11-27 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034427, 123023, 6999, '<td valign="top">That backround ... well, at least you''ve used a background, but this: why not use a clean board? Let the decay of the fruit speak for itself, what is added by having that mess on the background? you light seems good too - though I''m not sure that you''re quite in control of it - looking at those burnt-out highlights on the left-most thing, and the rim of the bowl.</td>', 'That backround ... well, at least you''ve used a background, but this: why not use a clean board? Let the decay of the fruit speak for itself, what is added by having that mess on the background? you light seems good too - though I''m not sure that you''re quite in control of it - looking at those burnt-out highlights on the left-most thing, and the rim of the bowl.', '2004-11-27 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034519, 122367, 26311, '<td valign="top">Simply perfect ....10<br/></td>', 'Simply perfect ....10', '2004-11-27 19:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034527, 123052, 6520, '<td valign="top">Excellent 10</td>', 'Excellent 10', '2004-11-27 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034528, 123148, 6520, '<td valign="top">I`m 43 and I don`t get that much stubble in a day but well done just the same 8</td>', 'I`m 43 and I don`t get that much stubble in a day but well done just the same 8', '2004-11-27 20:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034532, 122742, 6520, '<td valign="top">Tripple dunking is not allowed 10! Good luck</td>', 'Tripple dunking is not allowed 10! Good luck', '2004-11-27 20:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
