(1034896, 122994, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite like your burning - or however it wa done - giving that useful sense of focus. The only downside of it is that the contrast seems to have gone a bit along the wall and where the staircase is on the keep itself. Strong sense of composition, though I''d perhaps argue with your title - it seems more redolent of endurance of 1000 years than of much decay. Nice work.</td>', 'Quite like your burning - or however it wa done - giving that useful sense of focus. The only downside of it is that the contrast seems to have gone a bit along the wall and where the staircase is on the keep itself. Strong sense of composition, though I''d perhaps argue with your title - it seems more redolent of endurance of 1000 years than of much decay. Nice work.', '2004-11-28 08:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034897, 123166, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like? Isn''t it actually that, and thus not ''like'' it at all? Good tonality, sense of movement without losing detail.</td>', 'Like? Isn''t it actually that, and thus not ''like'' it at all? Good tonality, sense of movement without losing detail.', '2004-11-28 08:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
