(1035144, 123011, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done--I can see someone making a watercolor from it.  A different angle might have provided more room at the top to "push" the subject down and give it even more of that diminutive, sinking feeling.  Detail and colors are so sweet!  Luck in the voting!</td>', 'This is beautifully done--I can see someone making a watercolor from it.  A different angle might have provided more room at the top to "push" the subject down and give it even more of that diminutive, sinking feeling.  Detail and colors are so sweet!  Luck in the voting!', '2004-11-28 16:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
