(1035270, 123103, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium/strong - but this feels like Times Past more than the sensation of time actually passing.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: competent, composition OK, but the arrangement feels a bit too staged for me.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium/strong - but this feels like Times Past more than the sensation of time actually passing. Image critique: competent, composition OK, but the arrangement feels a bit too staged for me. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much.', '2004-11-28 19:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035274, 123062, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong - a nice idea, well executed.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: subjects are very appropriate to the challenge but you are a victim here of poor, flat light (but if, like me you''ve had bland or poor weather then I understand!). Strong composition lifts this out of the ordinary with great DOF.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: a bit bland overall (just the damn light really!) to hold me for long.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong - a nice idea, well executed. Image critique: subjects are very appropriate to the challenge but you are a victim here of poor, flat light (but if, like me you''ve had bland or poor weather then I understand!). Strong composition lifts this out of the ordinary with great DOF. Out-of-challenge appeal: a bit bland overall (just the damn light really!) to hold me for long.', '2004-11-28 19:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035277, 121884, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong. Creative, fun approach.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: instantly memorable and striking composition. Why not?<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I like it.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Creative, fun approach. Image critique: instantly memorable and striking composition. Why not? Out-of-challenge appeal: I like it.', '2004-11-28 19:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035279, 123146, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>:<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: unusual image - I can''t recall having seen a whirlpool like this, so a great use of the slow shutter/ND. Composition is a bit busy, but difficult to avoid, although crouching down a bit may have got more falls and fewer twigs.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I really love the feel of this.</td>', 'Challenge link: Image critique: unusual image - I can''t recall having seen a whirlpool like this, so a great use of the slow shutter/ND. Composition is a bit busy, but difficult to avoid, although crouching down a bit may have got more falls and fewer twigs. Out-of-challenge appeal: I really love the feel of this.', '2004-11-28 19:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035286, 122993, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a pleasant scene, but lacking in good directional light. A tripod is essential here and an ND filter would assist in reducing glare and blown highlights while allowing slower shutter speeds in daylight.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much mainly due to image quality.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium. Image critique: a pleasant scene, but lacking in good directional light. A tripod is essential here and an ND filter would assist in reducing glare and blown highlights while allowing slower shutter speeds in daylight. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much mainly due to image quality.', '2004-11-28 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035290, 122994, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium/strong. Theme is bit to like The Past here for me, rather than the sensation of time passing by.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a strong composition and impressive subject. However, the editing is a bit transparent here which distracts me from the photo. Highlights are quite blown (sky is overpowering) and some midtone dodging has left some faded areas at the centre. I know this place I think (Castle Rising?) but I can''t be sure.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not much due to editing anomalies.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium/strong. Theme is bit to like The Past here for me, rather than the sensation of time passing by. Image critique: a strong composition and impressive subject. However, the editing is a bit transparent here which distracts me from the photo. Highlights are quite blown (sky is overpowering) and some midtone dodging has left some faded areas at the centre. I know this place I think (Castle Rising?) but I can''t be sure. Out-of-challenge appeal: not much due to editing anomalies.', '2004-11-28 19:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035292, 123081, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth exposure. Good job.</td>', 'Nice smooth exposure. Good job.', '2004-11-28 19:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035319, 121884, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice execution of this theme. Someone had to do it for this challenge and you pulled it off. Great use of negative space. Hmm, would that still be considered negative space, since it is pretty much the subject? The paint drying. Or is the painter the subject? Either way, I like it.</td>', 'Nice execution of this theme. Someone had to do it for this challenge and you pulled it off. Great use of negative space. Hmm, would that still be considered negative space, since it is pretty much the subject? The paint drying. Or is the painter the subject? Either way, I like it.', '2004-11-28 19:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035333, 123098, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The picture seems a little too bright overall though. But maybe it''s just me, or my screen. Perhaps a little more contrast.</td>', 'Nice idea. The picture seems a little too bright overall though. But maybe it''s just me, or my screen. Perhaps a little more contrast.', '2004-11-28 20:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035338, 123127, 26151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The B&amp;W works. Too bad it''s not really rush hour. But for this woman it seems like it is, and I guess that''s the point.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The B&W works. Too bad it''s not really rush hour. But for this woman it seems like it is, and I guess that''s the point.', '2004-11-28 20:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
