(1035558, 121663, 25500, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I find the gray splotchy region on the left side of the clock to be somewhat distracting, but the overall composition is great.  Adding the wooden model as an observer to the passage of time gives the photo a dramatic element that a lone clock would lack and provides a nice textural contrast of organic wood versus synthetic clock.  Also, the additional lines that the model adds to the photo makes it more dynamic.</td>', 'Well done.  I find the gray splotchy region on the left side of the clock to be somewhat distracting, but the overall composition is great.  Adding the wooden model as an observer to the passage of time gives the photo a dramatic element that a lone clock would lack and provides a nice textural contrast of organic wood versus synthetic clock.  Also, the additional lines that the model adds to the photo makes it more dynamic.', '2004-11-28 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
