(1035861, 122994, 16004, '<td valign="top">would just like to thank the nine below for the constructive and illustrative comments.  the quality of each and everyone is considerably higher than normal, so i was just moved to say, cheers, thanks guys.<br/> <br/>note about the shot - in the last week or so i''ve been in a bit of a muddle with regards to monitor calibration.  on my home PC, the above looks great, but everywhere else, the centre looks very grey and shoddy.  i''m hopin it''s all been sorted now...</td>', 'would just like to thank the nine below for the constructive and illustrative comments.  the quality of each and everyone is considerably higher than normal, so i was just moved to say, cheers, thanks guys. note about the shot - in the last week or so i''ve been in a bit of a muddle with regards to monitor calibration.  on my home PC, the above looks great, but everywhere else, the centre looks very grey and shoddy.  i''m hopin it''s all been sorted now...', '2004-11-29 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
