(1036004, 122470, 29132, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on this photo. I agree with both the score (I would have given myself a 4) and your constructive criticism (a pretty picture that fell short of illustrating the theme of "Time Passing"). This was my first challenge entry. Now that I have a better idea of how the process works, I think I can do a better job in the future of being creative.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on this photo. I agree with both the score (I would have given myself a 4) and your constructive criticism (a pretty picture that fell short of illustrating the theme of "Time Passing"). This was my first challenge entry. Now that I have a better idea of how the process works, I think I can do a better job in the future of being creative.', '2004-11-29 07:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
