(1036506, 123045, 12448, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>This is an interesting shot.  It meets the challenge without a doubt but there is something about it that both fasinates me and bothers me.  It''s well done, the composure, the clarity overall but there is  touch of graininess that seems just a bit, a very little bit much.  Also the negative space around the edge seems a bit much to me.  While the subject is well centered and certainly draws your attention because it is brighter than the rest the large amount of border or black space ends up being a distraction to me.<br/> <br/>The color of the white on the clock face seems a bit dark also and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  I think if it was a more sharp contrast, brighter, popped out more it might have done a bit better.<br/> <br/>I like this shot overall and hope this helps.<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! This is an interesting shot.  It meets the challenge without a doubt but there is something about it that both fasinates me and bothers me.  It''s well done, the composure, the clarity overall but there is  touch of graininess that seems just a bit, a very little bit much.  Also the negative space around the edge seems a bit much to me.  While the subject is well centered and certainly draws your attention because it is brighter than the rest the large amount of border or black space ends up being a distraction to me. The color of the white on the clock face seems a bit dark also and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  I think if it was a more sharp contrast, brighter, popped out more it might have done a bit better. I like this shot overall and hope this helps. Deannda', '2004-11-29 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1036811, 123009, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail, light and texture. Sharpening has left clear pixel blocks in some areas and background is maybe a bit too much of a 50/50 split with the feeling that something should be happening there.<br/>: )</td>', 'Lovely detail, light and texture. Sharpening has left clear pixel blocks in some areas and background is maybe a bit too much of a 50/50 split with the feeling that something should be happening there.: )', '2004-11-29 19:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1036947, 122186, 18552, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon, Bob! It is an honor to be in the same top three as this picture you took. It is such a clever idea and very well executed.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon, Bob! It is an honor to be in the same top three as this picture you took. It is such a clever idea and very well executed.', '2004-11-29 21:11:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1036952, 122699, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture, Bill, it really earned the Blue Ribbon as it is such a cute, clever idea and turned out so well. Congratulations on your first ribbon, it is an honor for me to share the top three of this challenge with you.</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture, Bill, it really earned the Blue Ribbon as it is such a cute, clever idea and turned out so well. Congratulations on your first ribbon, it is an honor for me to share the top three of this challenge with you.', '2004-11-29 21:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
