(1087795, 121203, 31456, '<td valign="top">wow...the light and focus on this gives it an awesome old, almost nostalgic feeling...looks like an old drawing<br/> <br/>plus, the whole camel thing is what makes it really fit the "Time Passing" subject<br/> <br/>im surprised it didnt rate higher</td>', 'wow...the light and focus on this gives it an awesome old, almost nostalgic feeling...looks like an old drawing plus, the whole camel thing is what makes it really fit the "Time Passing" subject im surprised it didnt rate higher', '2005-01-02 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
