(1102552, 122816, 27421, '<td valign="top">Very nice, (and doesn''t the shutter "stop time",as the first commentor pointed out)? Just came across this today...</td>', 'Very nice, (and doesn''t the shutter "stop time",as the first commentor pointed out)? Just came across this today...', '2005-01-11 23:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1108097, 122352, 29079, '<td valign="top">I think the photo would have a better effect with less black edges, for me personally too dark, but I love the idea and composition</td>', 'I think the photo would have a better effect with less black edges, for me personally too dark, but I love the idea and composition', '2005-01-14 19:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1134146, 122983, 10985, '<td valign="top">Cool! Great idea. Thanks for the tip!</td>', 'Cool! Great idea. Thanks for the tip!', '2005-01-26 19:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1153617, 122352, 26464, '<td valign="top">awesome work, i like how it is framed in darkness. adds to the dreamlike appeal.<br/></td>', 'awesome work, i like how it is framed in darkness. adds to the dreamlike appeal.', '2005-02-06 17:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1447641, 123165, 37200, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  It definitely grabbed me right off.  I really don''t have any suggestion for improvement.  Framing/cropping is excellent, as well as exposure.</td>', 'I really like this one.  It definitely grabbed me right off.  I really don''t have any suggestion for improvement.  Framing/cropping is excellent, as well as exposure.', '2005-06-11 14:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1477978, 121663, 368, '<td valign="top">the tones are great here</td>', 'the tones are great here', '2005-06-23 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1527545, 122433, 3087, '<td valign="top">B/W Mentor Group.<br/> <br/>This is such a beautiful study, very intimate and full of emotion. I love the high contrast black and white - it works well to really show the textures in the younger and older skin and I like the way the lighting really brings out every contour. I am not really sure about the large empty area to the right - it doesn''t strike me as an image that benefits from that negative space. I''m also not keen on the selective desaturation here as it puts the focus on the ring rather than the relationship between the owners of the two hands (since it''s fairly clear the ring isn''t about the bond between these two individuals).</td>', 'B/W Mentor Group. This is such a beautiful study, very intimate and full of emotion. I love the high contrast black and white - it works well to really show the textures in the younger and older skin and I like the way the lighting really brings out every contour. I am not really sure about the large empty area to the right - it doesn''t strike me as an image that benefits from that negative space. I''m also not keen on the selective desaturation here as it puts the focus on the ring rather than the relationship between the owners of the two hands (since it''s fairly clear the ring isn''t about the bond between these two individuals).', '2005-07-11 17:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530656, 122433, 2170, '<td valign="top">B/W Club!<br/> <br/>i love this shot.  it really tells a story and gives some emotion.  i''m not a big fan of selective desaturation -- here i think this image is powerful enough without the need to draw the user to the ring (i think the ring is only pertinent if this were a shot of a couple or if there were two rings to work with).<br/> <br/>the color and tones are great.  the dark sweater sleeve is SO dark that it leaves a little bit of a hole in the shot, but it''s nothing that can''t be corrected just a tad.  :)</td>', 'B/W Club! i love this shot.  it really tells a story and gives some emotion.  i''m not a big fan of selective desaturation -- here i think this image is powerful enough without the need to draw the user to the ring (i think the ring is only pertinent if this were a shot of a couple or if there were two rings to work with). the color and tones are great.  the dark sweater sleeve is SO dark that it leaves a little bit of a hole in the shot, but it''s nothing that can''t be corrected just a tad.  :)', '2005-07-12 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530948, 122433, 37444, '<td valign="top">Using B&amp;W here intensifies the emotional impact. Not too keen on the gold ring though :(<br/>You are right about the sweater muckpond. I might not have noticed that if I hadn''t read your post.</td>', 'Using B&W here intensifies the emotional impact. Not too keen on the gold ring though :(You are right about the sweater muckpond. I might not have noticed that if I hadn''t read your post.', '2005-07-12 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1534223, 122433, 39144, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I haven''t seen it in color yet, but I can imagine that it definitely is more appropriate in b/w. I agree that the ring distracts from the overall image.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I haven''t seen it in color yet, but I can imagine that it definitely is more appropriate in b/w. I agree that the ring distracts from the overall image.', '2005-07-13 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1534419, 122433, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is simply lovely. The single saturation of the gold ring is really nice although I''d like it equally as well if all black and white.  The texture is excellent. It evokes a sweet nostalgia.  Bravo!</td>', 'This is simply lovely. The single saturation of the gold ring is really nice although I''d like it equally as well if all black and white.  The texture is excellent. It evokes a sweet nostalgia.  Bravo!', '2005-07-14 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
